#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/member_partner_module.rst:3
msgid "Membership / Partnership module"
msgstr "会员 / 合作伙伴模块"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/member_partner_module.rst:5
msgid ""
"The Membership / Partnership module allows for the creation and sale of "
"memberships. Memberships can be sold through both sales orders and "
"subscriptions products so that businesses can organize and interact with "
"customers as members. This allows for:"
msgstr ""
"会员 / 合作伙伴模块支持会员资格的创建与售卖。企业可通过销售订单和订阅商品两种"
"方式销售会员资格，从而将客户转化为会员进行系统化管理与互动。该模块可实现以下"
"功能："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/member_partner_module.rst:9
msgid "measuring membership activity, inactivity, sign ups, and churn rates"
msgstr "统计会员活跃度、休眠状态、新注册量及客户流失率"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/member_partner_module.rst:10
msgid "viewing membership renewals and expirations"
msgstr "查看会员资格续期与到期情况"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/member_partner_module.rst:11
msgid "following up on membership dues and associated payments"
msgstr "跟进会员费缴纳进度及相关款项支付状态"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/member_partner_module.rst:12
msgid ""
"communicating with members, including sending email blasts based on members' "
"current status"
msgstr "与会员进行定向沟通，包括根据会员当前状态批量发送邮件通知"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/member_partner_module.rst:13
msgid "assigning different membership levels to members"
msgstr "为会员分配不同的会员等级"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/member_partner_module.rst:14
msgid "organizing members-only events"
msgstr "举办会员专属活动"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/member_partner_module.rst:15
msgid ""
"creating membership lists populated with contact info and other details "
"about members."
msgstr "创建会员名录，录入会员联系方式及其他详细信息。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/member_partner_module.rst:18
msgid "The Membership / Partnership module vs. the Membership app"
msgstr "会员 / 合作伙伴模块与原会员应用的对比"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/member_partner_module.rst:20
msgid ""
"Beginning with 19.0, the **Membership** app has been replaced by the "
"Membership / Partnership module. This module captures all of the "
"functionality of the **Membership** app, but in a module that is better "
"integrated with other essential apps without requiring a specific "
"**Accounting** module. This replacement does not break any existing "
"membership information when upgrading to 19.0."
msgstr ""
"从 19.0 版本起，原**会员**应用已由会员 / 合作伙伴模块替代。该模块不仅完全继承"
"了原**会员**应用的全部功能，还实现了与其他核心应用的更优集成，且无需依赖特定"
"的**会计**核算模块即可运行。升级至 19.0 版本时，此次模块替换不会造成原有会员"
"数据丢失。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/member_partner_module.rst:26
msgid "App integrations with the Membership / Partnership module"
msgstr "会员 / 合作伙伴模块的应用整合能力"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/member_partner_module.rst:28
msgid ""
"Once activated, the Membership / Partnership module is fully integrated with "
"both the **Sales** and **Subscriptions** apps. The module is also compatible "
"with the **eCommerce** app, allowing customers to purchase memberships "
"through business's websites."
msgstr ""
"模块激活后，可与**销售**管理应用和**订阅**管理应用实现全面整合，同时兼容**电"
"子商务**应用，支持客户通过企业官网购买会员资格。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/member_partner_module.rst:32
msgid ""
"Finally, the Membership / Partnership module is compatible with pricelists "
"both before and after sales. Price rules can be set before memberships are "
"sold and applied after they are active."
msgstr ""
"最后，会员/合作伙伴模块与销售前和销售后的价格表兼容。价格规则可以在会籍销售前"
"设定，也可以在会籍激活后应用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/member_partner_module.rst:36
msgid "Activating the new module"
msgstr "新模块激活步骤"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/member_partner_module.rst:38
msgid ""
"The Memberships / Partnerships module can be activated within the **CRM** "
"app. To activate the Memberships / Partnerships module, go "
"to :menuselection:`CRM app --> Configuration --> Settings`. In "
"the :guilabel:`CRM` section, check the :guilabel:`Membership / Partnership` "
"box to activate the module. The name given to affiliates can also be "
"customized. By default, it is set to `Members`."
msgstr ""
"会员资格/合作伙伴关系模块可在**CRM**应用程序中激活。要激活会员资格/合作伙伴关"
"系模块，请访问 :menuselection:`CRM 应用程序 --> 配置 --> 设置`。"
"在:guilabel:`CRM`部分，选中 :guilabel:`会员资格/合作伙伴关系`框以激活该模块。"
"联属会员的名称也可以自定义。默认设置为 `会员`。"

