#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:147
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Expected MRR`: Measures the expected monthly recurring revenue of "
"an opportunity."
msgstr "\\ :guilabel:`预期 MRR`\\ ：衡量商机的预期月度经常性收入。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:148
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Prorated MRR`: Measures the prorated monthly recurring revenue of "
