#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:235
msgid ""
"If customers have only one eWallet program, the available balance is applied "
"automatically."
msgstr "如果客户只有一个电子钱包程序，则会自动应用可用余额。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:240
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing.rst:3
msgid "Pricelists"
msgstr "价目表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:242
msgid ""
"Pricelists allow you to automate price adjustments based on specific "
"criteria. They can be used to set POS-specific prices, create temporary "
"discount periods, reward loyal customers, or offer bulk-buy discounts."
msgstr ""
"价目表允许您根据特定标准自动调整价格。它们可用于设置销售点（POS）专用价格、创"
"建临时折扣期、奖励忠实客户或提供批量购买折扣。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:249
msgid "To enable pricelists in the Point of Sale app:"
msgstr "要在销售点应用中启用价目表，请按以下步骤操作："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:251
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Point of Sale --> Configuration --> Settings`."
msgstr "导航至 :menuselection:`销售点 --> 配置 --> 设置`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:252
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Pricing` section, activate the :guilabel:`Flexible "
"Pricelists` feature and :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`定价` 区域，激活 :guilabel:`灵活价目表` 功能，然后点"
"击 :guilabel:`保存`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:254
msgid ""
"Once the page reloads, click :icon:`oi-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Pricelists` "
"to :ref:`configure the pricelists <sales/products/pricelist-configuration>`."
msgstr ""
"页面重新加载后，点击 :icon:`oi-arrow-right` :guilabel:`价目表`，即可 :ref:`配"
"置价目表 <sales/products/pricelist-configuration>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:256
msgid ""
"When configured, return to the :ref:`POS settings <pos/use/settings>` to add "
"all relevant pricelists to the :guilabel:`Available` field, and select the "
"one to be used as the :guilabel:`Default`."
msgstr ""
"配置完成后，返回 :ref:`销售点设置 <pos/use/settings>`，将所有相关价目表添加"
"到 :guilabel:`可用价目表` 字段，并选择一个作为 :guilabel:`默认价目表`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:261
msgid "Assign pricelists"
msgstr "分配价目表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:263
msgid ""
"To manually assign a pricelist to an order from the :ref:`POS register <pos/"
"use/open-register>`, click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` (:guilabel:`vertical "
"ellipsis`) icon and the :icon:`fa-th-list` icon, followed by the currently "
"selected pricelist's name. Then, click the new pricelist to apply."
msgstr ""
"若要在 :ref:`POS 收银台 <pos/use/open-register>` 中手动为订单分配价目表，请依"
"次点击 :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v`（:guilabel:`垂直省略号`）图标和 :icon:`fa-th-"
"list` 图标，然后点击当前选中的价目表名称。接着，点击新的价目表以应用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:268
msgid ""
"You can also set a pricelist to be selected automatically for a "
"specific :ref:`customer <pos/use/customers>`. To do so, go "
"to :menuselection:`Point of Sale --> Orders --> Customers`, select the "
"relevant customer, and assign a pricelist in the :guilabel:`Pricelist` field "
"of the :guilabel:`Sales` section in the :guilabel:`Sales & Purchase` tab."
msgstr ""
"您还可以为特定的:ref:`customer <pos/use/customers>` 设置自动选用的价目表。要"
"执行此操作，进入:menuselection:`POS --> 订单 --> 客户` ，选择相关客户，并"
"在 :guilabel:`销售与采购` 选项卡的:guilabel:`销售` 部分中，于:guilabel:`价目"
"表` 字段中分配价格表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:274
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/labor_service_products.rst:243
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:260
msgid ":doc:`../../sales/products_prices/prices/pricing`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../sales/products_prices/prices/pricing`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:275
msgid ":ref:`Pricelists in eCommerce <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>`"
msgstr ":ref:`电子商务中的价目表 <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:280
msgid "Cash rounding"
msgstr "现金舍入"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:282
msgid ""
"Cash rounding is used when the smallest physical currency denomination (the "
"smallest coin) is higher than the minimum unit of account."
msgstr ""
"当最小的实物货币面额（最小硬币）高于最小记账单位时，将采用现金四舍五入。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:285
msgid ""
"For example, in countries that have phased out one-cent and two-cent coins, "
"businesses must round the total amount of a cash transaction to the nearest "
"five cents. In Odoo, each point of sale can be individually configured to "
"apply these rounding rules to bills and receipts."
msgstr ""
"例如，在已逐步淘汰一美分和两美分硬币的国家，商家必须将现金交易的总金额四舍五"
"入至最接近的五美分。在 Odoo 中，每个 POS 可单独配置，以将这些四舍五入规则应用"
"于账单和收据。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:292
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/receipt_printers.rst:40
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/scale.rst:31
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/scale.rst:56
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use/pos_invoices.rst:142
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Point of Sale --> Configuration --> Settings`."
msgstr "前往 :menuselection:`销售点 --> 配置 --> 设置`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:293
msgid "In the :guilabel:`Payment` section, enable :guilabel:`Cash Rounding`."
msgstr "在 :guilabel:`付款` 部分，启用 :guilabel:`现金四舍五入` 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:294
msgid ""
"Enable :guilabel:`Apply only on cash methods` to deactivate rounding "
"for :doc:`card payments <../payment_methods>`."
msgstr ""
"启用 :guilabel:`仅应用于现金方式`以停用 :doc:`卡付款<../ payment_methods>`的"
"舍入。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:296
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Rounding Method` field, select an existing method or "
"click :guilabel:`Create` to define a new one."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`舍入方法` 字段中，选择现有方法，或点击 guilabel:`创建` 来定义新"
"方法。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:299
msgid "When creating a new rounding method, define the following:"
msgstr "创建新的舍入方法时，请定义以下内容："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:301
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Rounding Precision`: The value of the smallest coinage available "
"(e.g., 0.05)."
msgstr ":guilabel:`舍入精度`：可用最小货币单位的数值（例如 0.05）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:302
msgid ":guilabel:`Rounding Strategy`: Choose how the adjustment is recorded:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`舍入策略`：选择调整值的记录方式："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:304
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Modify tax amount`: The rounding difference is applied in the "
"taxes section."
msgstr ":guilabel:`修改税额`：税费部分会应用四舍五入的差额。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:305
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Add a rounding line`: The rounding difference is added as a "
"separate line on the receipt and the invoice."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`添加四舍五入行`：四舍五入产生的差额将作为单独一行显示在收据和发票"
"上。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:307
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Profit Account` and :guilabel:`Loss Account`: The accounts used "
"to record the rounding discrepancies."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`利润账户` 和 :guilabel:`亏损账户`：用于记录四舍五入差异的账户。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:309
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Rounding Method`: The tie-breaking rule used to determine the "
"direction of the rounding (:guilabel:`Up`, :guilabel:`Down`, "
"or :guilabel:`Nearest`)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`舍入方法`：用于确定舍入方向的决胜规则（ :guilabel:`向上"
"`、 :guilabel:`向下` 或 :guilabel:`取最接近值`）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:313
msgid ""
"Odoo Point of Sale only supports the :guilabel:`Add a rounding line` "
"rounding strategy."
msgstr "Odoo 销售点仅支持 :guilabel:`添加舍入明细` 舍入策略。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:317
msgid "Example: Rounding a $19.92 total with a **rounding precision** of 0.05."
msgstr "示例： 对总计 $19.92 按**舍入精度** 0.05 进行舍入。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:319
msgid ""
"The final total changes depending on the **rounding method** selected in the "
"configuration:"
msgstr "最终总计将根据配置中选择的**舍入方式**而变化："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:327
msgid "Rounding method"
msgstr "舍入方式"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:328
msgid "Resulting total"
msgstr "最终总计"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:329
msgid "Logic"
msgstr "逻辑"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:330
msgid ":guilabel:`Up`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`向上舍入`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:331
msgid "$19.95"
msgstr "$19.95"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:332
msgid "Always rounds toward the higher value."
msgstr "始终向更大数值舍入。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:333
msgid ":guilabel:`Down`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`向下舍入`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:334
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:337
msgid "$19.90"
msgstr "$19.90"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:335
msgid "Always rounds toward the lower value."
msgstr "始终向更小数值舍入。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:336
msgid ":guilabel:`Nearest`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`四舍五入`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:338
msgid "Rounds to the nearest 0.05."
msgstr "舍入至最接近的 0.05 倍数。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:341
msgid ""
"Rounding only applies to the **Total** of the receipt, not to individual "
"product prices."
msgstr "舍入仅适用于小票的**总计金额**，不适用于单个商品价格。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:346
msgid "Flexible taxes (fiscal positions)"
msgstr "灵活税收（财务规则）"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:348
msgid ""
"When running a business, you may need to apply different taxes and record "
"transactions on various accounts based on the location and type of business "
"of your customers and providers."
msgstr ""
"经营企业时，您可能需要根据客户和供应商的所在地及业务类型，应用不同的税种并在"
"不同账户上记录交易"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:351
msgid ""
"Fiscal positions allow you to define rules that automatically select the "
"appropriate taxes and accounts used for each transaction."
msgstr "财务状况允许您定义规则，自动选择每项交易所使用的相应税种和账户"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:355
msgid ":doc:`../../../finance/accounting/taxes/fiscal_positions`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../../finance/accounting/taxes/fiscal_positions`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:356
msgid ":doc:`../../../finance/accounting/taxes`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../../finance/accounting/taxes`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:361
msgid ""
"To use fiscal positions, go to :menuselection:`Point of Sale --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`, scroll down to the :guilabel:`Accounting` "
"section, and enable :guilabel:`Flexible Taxes`."
msgstr ""
"若要使用财务状况，请访问 :menuselection:`POS --> 配置 --> 设置` ，滚动"
"至 :guilabel:`会计` 部分，并启用 :guilabel:`灵活税收` ”。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:364
msgid "Then, configure the fiscal position for your POS:"
msgstr "然后，配置您的 POS 的财务状况："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:366
msgid ""
"Set the default fiscal position to be automatically applied to all sales in "
"the selected POS using the :guilabel:`Default` field."
msgstr ""
"使用 :guilabel:`默认` 字段，将默认财务状况设置为自动应用于所选 POS 中的所有销"
"售。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:368
msgid ""
"Select additional fiscal positions in the :guilabel:`Allowed` field to make "
"them selectable during sales."
msgstr "在 :guilabel:`允许` 字段中选择其他财务状况，以便在销售过程中可供选择。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:371
msgid ""
"Depending on the installed :doc:`fiscal localization package </applications/"
"finance/fiscal_localizations>`, several fiscal positions are already "
"preconfigured and ready to use in the POS. You can also :ref:`create new "
"ones <fiscal_positions/configuration>` if needed."
msgstr ""
"根据已安装的 :doc:`财务本地套装 </applications/finance/"
"fiscal_localizations>` ，POS 中已预配置了若干财务状况并可供使用。如有需要，您"
"还可以 :ref:`创建新的 <fiscal_positions/configuration>` 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:377
msgid ""
":ref:`A default fiscal position can also be assigned to a customer "
"<accounting/fiscal_positions/partner>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`默认财务规则也可以分配给客户 <accounting/fiscal_positions/partner>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:379
msgid ""
"If no fiscal position is configured, the tax defined in the "
"product's :guilabel:`Sales Taxes` field is applied."
msgstr "若未配置任何财务规则，则应用产品 :guilabel:`销售税种` 字段中定义的税种"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:383
msgid ""
"Use :doc:`presets <presets>` to define specific fiscal positions based on "
"whether customers dine in, take their order to go, or have it delivered."
msgstr ""
"使用\\ :doc:`预设 <presets>`\\ 来根据客户是用餐、外带还是配送来定义特定的财务"
"状况。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:387
msgid "Apply fiscal positions"
msgstr "应用财务规则"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:389
msgid ""
"To apply a fiscal position to a POS order in the :ref:`POS register <pos/use/"
"open-register>`, click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` (:guilabel:`vertical "
"ellipsis`) icon, click the :icon:`fa-book` :guilabel:`Tax` button, and "
"choose the desired fiscal position from the list."
msgstr ""
"如需在 :ref:`销售点（POS）收银机 <pos/use/open-register>` 中为订单应用财务规"
"则，点击 :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v`（:guilabel:`垂直省略号`）图标，点击 :icon:`fa-"
"book` :guilabel:`税种` 按钮，然后从列表中选择所需的财务规则。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:5
msgid ""
"The self-ordering mode allows customers to browse the menu or product "
"catalog, place an order, and complete payment using their mobile device or a "
"self-ordering kiosk."
msgstr ""
"自助点餐模式允许客户浏览菜单或产品目录、下单，并使用其移动设备或自助点餐机完"
"成支付。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:13
msgid ""
"To enable the self-ordering mode, access the :ref:`POS settings <pos/use/"
"settings>`, scroll down to the :guilabel:`Mobile self-order & Kiosk` "
"section, and, in the :guilabel:`QR menu & Kiosk activation` section, select "
"a :guilabel:`Self Ordering` type from the dropdown list."
msgstr ""
"要启用自助点餐模式，请访问\\ :ref:`POS 设置 <pos/use/settings>`\\，向下滚动至"
"\\ :guilabel:`移动自助点餐和自助服务机`\\ 部分，然后在\\ :guilabel:`二维码菜"
"单和自助服务机激活`\\ 部分中，从下拉列表中选择一种\\ :guilabel:`自助点餐`\\ "
"类型。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:18
msgid ""
"You can choose between :guilabel:`QR menu`, :guilabel:`QR menu + Ordering`, "
"and :guilabel:`Kiosk`."
msgstr ""
"您可以选择\\ :guilabel:`二维码菜单`\\、\\ :guilabel:`二维码菜单 + 点餐`\\ "
"和\\ :guilabel:`自助服务机`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:22
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:99
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:207
msgid "QR menu"
msgstr "QR 菜单"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:24
msgid ""
"Select :guilabel:`QR menu` or :guilabel:`QR menu + Ordering` to give "
"customers access to the menu or product catalog by scanning a QR code on "
"their personal device. The latter also allows them to place an order and "
"make a payment. Then:"
msgstr ""
"选择\\ :guilabel:`二维码菜单`\\ 或\\ :guilabel:`二维码菜单 + 点餐`\\，让客户"
"通过扫描个人设备上的二维码来访问菜单或产品目录。后者还允许他们下单并进行支付"
"。然后："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:28
msgid ""
"Click :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Print QR Codes` to download a .pdf "
"document with the generated QR codes."
msgstr ""
"点击 :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`打印二维码`，可下载包含生成二维码的PDF"
"文档。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:30
msgid ""
"Click :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Download QR Codes` to download a "
"compressed file with the generated QR codes."
msgstr ""
"点击 :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`下载二维码`，可下载包含生成二维码的压"
"缩文件"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:32
msgid ""
"Click :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Free Metal / Wood Stands` to `order "
"QR code stands from Odoo <https://www.odoo.com/app/point-of-sale-restaurant-"
"qr-code>`_."
msgstr ""
"按一下\\ :icon:`fa-arrow-right`\\ :guilabel:`免费金属/木制支架`\\ 以`向 Odoo "
"订购二维码支架\\ <https://www.odoo.com/app/point-of-sale-restaurant-qr-code>"
"`_。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:36
msgid ""
"In :ref:`restaurants <pos/restaurant/floors>`, printing or downloading QR "
"codes generates as many QR codes as the number of available tables. In "
"**shops**, it generates only one generic QR code."
msgstr ""
"在 :ref:`餐厅场景 <pos/restaurant/floors>` 中，打印或下载二维码时，将生成与可"
"用餐桌数量相同的二维码；在 **商店** 中，仅生成一个通用二维码。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:40
msgid ""
"To customize QR codes, scan the relevant QR code to acquire its URL, then "
"use a QR code generator (e.g., `QR code monkey <https://www.qrcode-"
"monkey.com>`_, `QR code generator <https://www.qr-code-generator.com>`_, or "
"`JustMakeTheQRCode.com <https://justmaketheqrcode.com/>`_) to create a "
"custom QR code."
msgstr ""
"要自定义二维码，请扫描相关二维码以获取其 URL，然后使用二维码生成器（例如 `QR "
"code monkey\\ <https://www.qrcode-monkey.com>`_， `QR code generator\\ "
"<https://www.qr-code-generator.com>`_， 或 `JustMakeTheQRCode.com\\ <https://"
"justmaketheqrcode.com/>`_）来创建自定义二维码。"

