#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:77
msgid ""
"Select the :guilabel:`Points of Sale` to ensure this button only appears on "
"the selected POS's self-ordering interface."
msgstr ""
"选择 :guilabel:`销售点`，确保该按钮仅显示在所选销售点（POS）的自助订购界面上"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:79
msgid "Select a predefined :guilabel:`Style` from the dropdown menu."
msgstr "从下拉菜单中选择预设的 :guilabel:`样式`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:82
msgid ""
"Leaving the :guilabel:`Points of Sale` field empty shares the button with "
"all POS."
msgstr ""
"若 :guilabel:`销售点` 字段留空，该按钮将在所有销售点（POS）的自助订购界面显"
