#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:83
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Preview` column automatically updates to show the button's "
"appearance for the selected :guilabel:`Style`."
msgstr ""
"\\ :guilabel:`预览`\\ 列会自动更新，以显示所选\\ :guilabel:`样式`\\ 的按钮外"
"观。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:86
msgid "Service location and payment options"
msgstr "服务地点及付款方式"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:88
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Service at` field, specify where the service takes place "
"by selecting :guilabel:`Table` or :guilabel:`Pickup zone`. Then, in "
"the :guilabel:`Pay after` field, define when customers pay. Depending on the "
"self-ordering type, service location, and POS type, customers can pay after "
"their :guilabel:`Meal` or after :guilabel:`Each order` and choose from "
"different payment options."
msgstr ""
"在\\ :guilabel:`服务于`\\ 字段中，通过选择\\ :guilabel:`餐桌`\\ 或\\ "
":guilabel:`取餐区`\\ 来指定服务地点。然后，在\\ :guilabel:`付款时间`\\ 字段中"
"，定义客户的付款时间。根据自助点餐类型、服务地点和 POS 类型，客户可以在\\ "
":guilabel:`用餐后`\\ 或\\ :guilabel:`每笔订单后`\\ 付款，并从不同的付款选项中"
"进行选择。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:95
msgid ""
"Service zones can also be defined for :doc:`presets <presets>` used for self-"
"ordering."
msgstr "服务区域也可以为用于自助订餐的\\ :doc:`预设 <presets>`\\ 定义。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:101
msgid ""
"**Restaurants**: Customers can be served at their :guilabel:`Table` or at "
"the :guilabel:`Pickup zone`."
msgstr ""
"**餐厅**：顾客可以在\\ :guilabel:`餐桌`\\ 或\\ :guilabel:`取餐区`\\ 接受服务"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:104
msgid ""
"For :guilabel:`Table` service, they can pay after their :guilabel:`Meal` or "
"after :guilabel:`Each order`."
msgstr ""
"对于\\ :guilabel:`餐桌`\\ 服务，顾客可以在\\ :guilabel:`用餐`\\ 后或\\ "
":guilabel:`每笔订单`\\ 后付款。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:106
msgid ""
"For :guilabel:`Pickup zone` service, they can only pay after :guilabel:`Each "
"order`."
msgstr ""
"对于\\ :guilabel:`自提区`\\ 服务，顾客只能在\\ :guilabel:`每笔订单`\\ 后付款"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:108
msgid ""
"**Shops**: Customers can only be served at the :guilabel:`Pickup zone` and "
"pay after :guilabel:`Each order`."
msgstr ""
"**商店**：顾客只能在\\ :guilabel:`自提区`\\ 接受服务，并在\\ :guilabel:`每笔"
"订单`\\ 后付款。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:110
msgid ""
"Customers can pay :doc:`online </applications/finance/payment_providers>` or "
"using any configured :doc:`payment method <../payment_methods>`. If "
"the :guilabel:`Online Payment` field is left empty, customers pay at the "
