#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:230
msgid ""
"On the POS user's end, click the :guilabel:`Start Kiosk` button on the POS "
"card."
msgstr "在 POS 用户端，点击 POS 卡片上的\\ :guilabel:`启动自助终端`\\ 按钮。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:233
