msgstr "在订购过程后"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use/pos_invoices.rst:70
msgid ""
"To create and issue, or reprint, an invoice to the customer from the POS "
"register after an order is processed, follow these steps:"
msgstr ""
"要在订单处理后通过 POS 收银机为客户创建并开具（或重新打印）发票，请按照以下步"
"骤操作："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use/pos_invoices.rst:73
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Orders` in the POS interface."
msgstr "在 POS 界面中点击\\ :guilabel:`订单`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use/pos_invoices.rst:74
msgid "Set the :guilabel:`Active` dropdown menu to :guilabel:`Paid`."
msgstr "将\\ :guilabel:`活跃`\\ 下拉菜单设置为\\ :guilabel:`已支付`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use/pos_invoices.rst:75
msgid ""
"Select the relevant order and click :icon:`fa-file-pdf-"
"o` :guilabel:`Invoice` above the numpad."
msgstr ""
"选择相关订单，然后点击数字键盘上方的\\ :icon:`fa-file-pdf-o`\\ :guilabel:`发"
"票`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use/pos_invoices.rst:80
msgid "From the backend"
msgstr "从后台"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use/pos_invoices.rst:82
msgid "To create and issue an invoice from the backend, follow these steps:"
msgstr "要从后台创建并开具发票，请按照以下步骤操作:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use/pos_invoices.rst:85
msgid "Select the relevant order."
msgstr "选择相关订单。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use/pos_invoices.rst:86
msgid "Add the :guilabel:`Customer` if needed, then click :guilabel:`Invoice`."
msgstr "如需要，添加\\ :guilabel:`客户`\\ ，然后点击\\ :guilabel:`发票`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use/pos_invoices.rst:91
msgid "Consolidated customer invoice"
msgstr "合并客户发票"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use/pos_invoices.rst:93
msgid ""
"To create a consolidated invoice for all orders linked to the same customer "
"that are not yet invoiced (i.e., invoices with an :guilabel:`Invoice Status` "
"set to :guilabel:`To Invoice`), follow these steps:"
msgstr ""
"要为同一客户关联的所有尚未开票的订单（即\\ :guilabel:`发票状态`\\ 设置为"
"\\ :guilabel:`待开票`\\ 的发票）创建合并发票，请按照以下步骤操作："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use/pos_invoices.rst:98
msgid ""
"Click the search bar and under :guilabel:`Group By` "
"select :guilabel:`Customer`."
msgstr "点击搜索栏，并在\\ :guilabel:`分组依据`\\ 下选择\\ :guilabel:`客户`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use/pos_invoices.rst:99
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-caret-right` (:guilabel:`caret`) icon next to the "
"relevant customer and enable :guilabel:`Order Ref` in the column header or "
"select the relevant orders."
msgstr ""
"点击相关客户旁边的\\ :icon:`fa-caret-right`\\ （:guilabel:`插入符号`）图标，"
"并在列标题中启用\\ :guilabel:`订单编号`\\ 或选择相关订单。"

