#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental.rst:70
msgid ""
"Odoo uses two rules to compute the price of a product when a rental order is "
"created:"
msgstr "创建租赁订单时，Odoo 使用两个规则来计算产品价格："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental.rst:72
msgid "Only one price line is used."
msgstr "仅使用一个价格行。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental.rst:73
msgid "The cheapest line is selected."
msgstr "选择最便宜的线路。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental.rst:76
msgid ""
"A bike rental company offers the following rental prices for its electric "
"bikes:"
msgstr "某自行车租赁公司为其电动自行车提供以下租赁价格："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental.rst:78
msgid "1 day: $100"
msgstr "1 天: $100"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental.rst:79
msgid "3 days: $250"
msgstr "3 天: $250"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental.rst:80
msgid "1 week: $500"
msgstr "1 周: $500"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental.rst:82
msgid ""
"A customer wants to rent this product for eight days. What price will they "
"pay?"
msgstr "一位客户想租用该产品八天。他们将支出什么价格？"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental.rst:84
msgid ""
"After the order is created, Odoo chooses the second line because it is the "
"lowest price. The customer pays three times the '3 days' rate to cover eight "
"days, totaling $750."
msgstr ""
"创建订单后，Odoo 会选择第二行，因为其价格最低。客户支付三次“3 天”费率来涵盖八"
"天，共计 $750。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental.rst:87
msgid ""
"1~\\text{day} * 8 &= 8~\\text{days} \\\\\n"
"3~\\text{days} + 3~\\text{days} + 3~\\text{days} &= 9~\\text{days} \\\\\n"
"1~\\text{week} + 1~\\text{week} &= 14~\\text{days} \\\\\n"
"\\\\\n"
"100 * 8 &= $800 \\\\\n"
"250 + 250 + 250 &= $750 \\\\\n"
"500 + 500 &= $1000\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"1~\\text{day} * 8 &= 8~\\text{days} \\\\\n"
"3~\\text{days} + 3~\\text{days} + 3~\\text{days} &= 9~\\text{days} \\\\\n"
"1~\\text{week} + 1~\\text{week} &= 14~\\text{days} \\\\\n"
"\\\\\n"
"100 * 8 &= $800 \\\\\n"
"250 + 250 + 250 &= $750 \\\\\n"
"500 + 500 &= $1000\n"
"\n"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental.rst:96
msgid "Therefore, the customer pays $750 for the eight-day rental period."
msgstr "因此，客户为这八天的租赁期支付 $750。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental.rst:101
msgid "Rental pricelist rules"
msgstr "租金价格表规则"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental.rst:103
msgid ""
"Extra rental prices are configured in the product's :guilabel:`Prices` tab. "
"The prices are configured like advanced :doc:`pricelists <sales/"
"products_prices/prices/pricing>`, where the following fields work as "
