#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders.rst:5
msgid "Rental orders"
msgstr "租赁订单"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:-1
msgid ""
"This page covers the rental order workflow in Odoo **Rental**, from creating "
"a quote and requesting a customer signature to tracking service time and "
"finalizing the invoice for payment."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:10
msgid ""
"In Odoo **Rental**, quotations are created and sent to customers, similar to "
"**Sales** quotations. Once a quotation is confirmed, it becomes a *rental "
"order* and can be invoiced and paid for. Only after a rental order is "
"confirmed can rental products be picked up."
msgstr ""
"在 Odoo **租赁**中，报价单的创建和发送方式与**销售**报价单类似。一旦报价单获"
"得确认，它就会变成*租赁订单*，并可进行开票和支付。只有在确认租赁订单后，才能"
"提取租赁产品。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:15
msgid ""
"To configure quotation settings, the **Sales** app **must** be installed. "
"Refer to :ref:`sales/create_quotations/quotation-settings` section on the "
"*Create quotations* page for detailed instructions."
msgstr ""
"要配置报价单设置，**必须**安装 **销售** 应用。有关详细说明，请参阅 *创建报价"
"单* 页面上的\\ :ref:`sales/create_quotations/quotation-settings`\\ 部分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:22
msgid "Create a rental quotation"
msgstr "创建租赁报价单"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:25
msgid ""
"Users can convert a :doc:`sales quotation <../../sales/sales_quotations/"
"create_quotations>` to a rental quotation by adding a rental product. Doing "
"so automatically adds the :guilabel:`Rental period` field. To convert a "
"rental quotation to a sales quote, remove the rental start and return dates."
msgstr ""
"用户可以通过添加租赁产品将\\ :doc:`销售报价单 <../../sales/sales_quotations/"
"create_quotations>`\\ 转换为租赁报价单。这样做会自动添加\\ :guilabel:`租赁"
"期`\\ 字段。若要将租赁报价单转换回销售报价单，请移除租赁开始和归还日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:30
msgid ""
"To create a rental quotation, open the **Rental** app and create one from "
"the *Rental Orders* dashboard or navigate to :menuselection:`Rental app --> "
"Orders --> Orders`, click :guilabel:`New` and select :guilabel:`New "
"Quotation`. Then complete the following steps:"
msgstr ""
"要创建租赁报价单，请打开 **租赁** 应用并从 *租赁订单* 仪表板创建，或导航至\\ "
":menuselection:`租赁应用 --> 订单 --> 订单`\\ ，点击\\ :guilabel:`新建`\\ 并"
"选择\\ :guilabel:`新建报价单`\\ 。然后完成以下步骤："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:34
msgid ""
"**Add a customer**: Enter or select a customer from the :guilabel:`Customer` "
"drop-down menu."
msgstr "**添加客户**：在\\ :guilabel:`客户`\\ 下拉菜单中输入或选择客户。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:35
msgid ""
"**Add a rental product**: In the *Order Lines* tab, click :guilabel:`Add "
"Line` or :guilabel:`Catalog`, and select the desired rental product."
msgstr ""
"**添加租赁产品**：在\\ *订单明细*\\ 选项卡中，单击\\ :guilabel:`添加行`\\ "
"或\\ :guilabel:`目录`\\ ，然后选择所需的租赁产品。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:37
msgid ""
"**Set the rental duration**: Select the desired dates and times via the pop-"
"up calendar for the :guilabel:`Rental period`."
msgstr "**设置租赁时长**：通过弹出日历为\\ :guilabel:`租赁期`\\ 选择所需日期和时间。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:39
msgid ""
"**Apply a pricelist** (optional): Select an option from "
"the :guilabel:`Pricelist` drop-down menu."
msgstr "**应用价格表**（可选）：在\\ :guilabel:`价格表`\\ 下拉菜单中选择一个选项。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:40
msgid ""
"**Send and confirm rental quotation**: Click :guilabel:`Send` to send the "
"quotation to the customer. When the customer confirms the quotation, "
"click :guilabel:`Confirm` to finalize the order. A :guilabel:`Booked` badge "
"displays on the rental order."
msgstr ""
"**发送并确认租赁报价单**：单击\\ :guilabel:`发送`\\ 将报价单发送给客户。当客"
"户确认报价单后，单击\\ :guilabel:`确认`\\ 以完成订单。租赁订单上会显示\\ "
":guilabel:`已预订`\\ 徽章。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:45
msgid ""
"There can only be one rental period per rental order. Multiple rental "
"product orders with different rental periods require a rental order for each "
"rental period."
msgstr ""
"每个出租订单只能有一个出租期限。具有不同出租期限的多个出租产品订单需要为每个"
"出租期限创建一个出租订单。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:49
msgid ""
"If :doc:`quotation templates <../../sales/sales_quotations/quote_template>` "
"are enabled, users can select and modify a template from the :guilabel:`New` "
"button drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"如果启用了\\ :doc:`报价单模板 <../../sales/sales_quotations/quote_template>"
"`\\ ，用户可从\\ :guilabel:`新建`\\ 按钮下拉菜单中选择并修改模板。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:52
msgid ""
"As long as the rental quotation isn't confirmed, the user can change "
"the :guilabel:`Rental period` or :doc:`Pricelist <../../sales/"
"products_prices/prices/pricing>` on the rental quotation. The **Rental** app "
"automatically updates the rental "
"product's :guilabel:`Hours`, :guilabel:`Unit Price`, and :guilabel:`Amount` "
"on the product line and the quotation :guilabel:`Total` after the change."
msgstr ""
"只要租赁报价单未确认，用户就可以更改租赁报价单上的\\ :guilabel:`租赁期`\\ "
"或\\ :doc:`价格表 <../../sales/products_prices/prices/pricing>`\\ 。更改后"
"，**租赁**应用会自动更新产品明细行中租赁产品的\\ :guilabel:`小时`\\ 、\\ "
":guilabel:`单价`\\ 和\\ :guilabel:`金额`\\ ，以及报价单的\\ :guilabel:`合"
"计`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:57
msgid ""
"When a rental order is confirmed, smart buttons may appear at the top of the "
"form, depending on the :ref:`app integrations <rental/product_type/app-"
"integration>`:"
msgstr ""
"当确认租赁订单时，窗体顶部可能会出现智能按钮，具体取决于\\ :ref:`应用集成 "
"<rental/product_type/app-integration>`："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:60
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-check` :guilabel:`Tasks`: Linked to the **Projects** app and shows "
"any projects or tasks related to the rental order."
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-check` :guilabel:`任务`：关联到**项目**应用，并显示与租赁订单相关的"
"任何项目或任务。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:62
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-clock-o` :guilabel:`Recorded`: Linked to the **Timesheets** app "
"and shows how many hours are related to the rental order."
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-clock-o`\\ :guilabel:`已记录`：链接到\\ **工时单**\\ 应用，显示与出"
"租订单相关的小时数。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:64
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-tasks` :guilabel:`Planned`: Linked to the **Planning** app and "
"shows how many shifts are related to the rental order."
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-tasks`\\ :guilabel:`已计划`：链接到\\ **计划**\\ 应用，显示与出租订"
"单相关的班次数量。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:66
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-truck` :guilabel:`Delivery`: Linked to the **Inventory** app and "
"shows any delivery and receipt orders related to the rental order."
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-truck`\\ :guilabel:`交付`：链接至**库存**应用，显示与该租赁订单相关"
"的任何交付和接收订单。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:69
msgid ""
"Sample of a filled-out rental order available in the Odoo Rental application."
msgstr "Odoo 租赁应用程序中提供的已填写租赁订单示例。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:75
msgid "Request a customer signature"
msgstr "请求客户签名"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:77
msgid ""
"Odoo can request that the customer sign a rental agreement outlining the "
"arrangement between the company and the customer *before* they pick up the "
"rental products. This document ensures everything is returned on time and in "
"its original condition."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 可以要求客户在提货\\ *之前*\\ 签署一份租赁协议，明确公司与客户之间的约定"
"。该文件可确保所有租赁产品均按时归还且完好无损。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:82
msgid ""
"Requesting a signature can be done during any stage of the order. This "
"feature also requires the :doc:`Sign <../../../productivity/sign>` app."
msgstr ""
"可以在订单的任何阶段请求签名。此功能还需要\\ :doc:`电子签名 <../../../"
"productivity/sign>`\\ 应用程序。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:85
msgid ""
"If signatures are required, go to the :menuselection:`Rental` app, and from "
"the default *Rental Orders* dashboard, select the desired rental order:"
msgstr ""
"如果需要签名，请转到\\ :menuselection:`租赁`\\ 应用，在默认的\\ *租赁订单*\\ "
"仪表板中选择所需的租赁订单："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:88
msgid "In the chatter section, click :guilabel:`Activity`."
msgstr "在讨论区中，单击\\ :guilabel:`活动`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:89
msgid ""
"In the *Schedule Activity* pop-up window, click :guilabel:`Signature "
"Request`."
msgstr "在\\ *安排活动*\\ 弹出窗口中，单击\\ :guilabel:`签名请求`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:90
msgid ""
":ref:`Select an existing document template <sign/request-signatures/template-"
"odoo-record>` or :ref:`upload a new one <sign/request-signatures/one-off-"
"record>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`选择现有文档模板 <sign/request-signatures/template-odoo-record>`\\ 或\\"
" :ref:`上传新模板 <sign/request-signatures/one-off-record>`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:93
msgid ""
"After sending the request, a link to the signature request appears in the "
"record's chatter. The document is accessible to the customer via the "
"customer portal or email."
msgstr ""
"发送请求后，签名请求的链接将显示在该记录的讨论区中。客户可通过客户门户或电子"
"邮件访问该文件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:97
msgid "`Odoo Tutorials: Sign <https://www.odoo.com/slides/sign-61>`_"
msgstr "`Odoo 教程: 签署 <https://www.odoo.com/slides/sign-61>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:102
msgid "Manage shifts for rental services"
msgstr "管理租赁服务的班次"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:104
msgid ""
"Confirmed rental orders containing :doc:`service products <../"
"configure_products/service_products>` with *Planned Services* enabled "
"trigger the automatic creation of shifts. When the availability matches the "
"designated rental period, shifts are generated for the assigned employee "
"role or material. This automation is made possible by the integration with "
"the **Planning** app and by configuring the service product."
msgstr ""
"包含已启用\\ *计划服务*\\ 的\\ :doc:`服务产品 <../configure_products/"
"service_products>`\\ 的已确认租赁订单会自动触发班次创建。当可用时间与指定的租"
"赁期匹配时，系统将为分配的员工角色或材料生成班次。此自动化功能通过与**排"
"班**应用的集成以及配置服务产品来实现。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:110
msgid "To edit a shift for a rental service, complete the following steps:"
msgstr "如要编辑租赁服务的班次，请按照以下步骤操作："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:112
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-tasks` :guilabel:`Planned` smart button to open the "
"*Schedule by Resource* page. The page defaults to a Gantt view of all the "
"open shifts and shifts for the associated role that are available for the "
"rental period of the rental order."
msgstr ""
"单击\\ :icon:`fa-tasks` :guilabel:`已计划`\\ 智能按钮以打开\\ *按资源排班*\\ "
"页面。该页面默认为甘特图视图，显示该租赁订单的租赁期内可用的所有待分配班次以"
"及相关角色的班次。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:115
msgid ":ref:`Edit or delete the shift <planning/shifts>` as needed."
msgstr ":ref:`编辑或删除班次 <planning/shifts>`\\ ，视需要而定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:120
msgid "Track time for an employee shift"
msgstr "记录员工班次工时"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:123
msgid ""
"The :ref:`rental pickup process <rental/pickup_return/pickup>` should be "
"completed before entering time for an employee shift. Otherwise, the rental "
"order status remains :guilabel:`Reserved` on the :doc:`Rental Orders "
"dashboard <rental_order_dashboard>`, which can make filtering confusing."
msgstr ""
"在为员工班次输入工时之前，应先完成\\ :ref:`租赁取货流程 <rental/"
"pickup_return/pickup>`。否则，租赁订单状态将保持为\\ :guilabel:`已预留`\\ （"
"在\\ :doc:`租赁订单仪表板 <rental_order_dashboard>`\\ 上），这可能会造成筛选"
"混乱。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:128
msgid ""
"Open the rental order for the rental service by going "
"to :menuselection:`Rental app --> Orders --> Orders` and selecting the "
"desired rental order."
msgstr ""
"要打开租赁服务的租赁订单，请前往\\ :menuselection:`租赁应用 --> 订单 --> 订"
"单`\\ 并选择所需的租赁订单。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:130
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-tasks` :guilabel:`Planned` smart button to open the "
"*Schedule by Resource* page."
msgstr ""
"点击\\ :icon:`fa-tasks` :guilabel:`已计划`\\ 智能按钮，打开\\ *按资源排班*\\ "
"页面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:132
msgid ""
"Click the employee shift, and in the pop-up window, click :guilabel:`Start` "
"to begin tracking time for the shift."
msgstr ""
"点击员工班次，然后在弹出窗口中点击\\ :guilabel:`开始`\\ 开始记录该班次的工时"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:134
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Complete` when the employee has completed their shift."
msgstr "员工完成班次后，点击\\ :guilabel:`完成`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:136
msgid ""
"The Schedule by Resource page with a photographer shift in the Rental app."
msgstr "出租应用中按资源排程页面，显示摄影师班次。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:142
msgid "Manage a project created from a rental order"
msgstr "管理从出租订单创建的项目"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:144
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-check` :guilabel:`Tasks` smart button at the top of the "
"rental order to display a Kanban view of all the tasks automatically created "
"when confirming the rental order. :doc:`Customize the project's tasks "
"<../../../services/project/tasks/task_creation>` as needed."
msgstr ""
"点击租赁订单顶部的\\ :icon:`fa-check` :guilabel:`任务`\\ 智能按钮，以看板视图"
"显示确认租赁订单时自动创建的所有任务。根据需要\\ :doc:`自定义项目任务 <../../"
"../services/project/tasks/task_creation>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:148
msgid ""
"To enter time for a rental service associated with a project task, refer to "
"the :ref:`rental/create_rental_order/time-for-employee-shift` section."
msgstr ""
"要为与项目任务关联的租赁服务输入工时，请参阅\\ :ref:`rental/"
"create_rental_order/time-for-employee-shift`\\ 章节。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:152
msgid ""
"Configuring the use of :doc:`../../../services/project/project_management/"
"project_templates` on the product form creates new projects with predefined "
"tasks, priority levels, and assigned employees. When integrated with the "
"**Planning** app, the system automatically schedules and publishes an "
"employee's shift if their availability matches the rental period. Priority "
"is given to employees with the relevant :ref:`roles <planning/planning-"
"roles>` if applicable."
msgstr ""
"在产品表单上配置使用\\ :doc:`../../../services/project/project_management/"
"project_templates`\\ 可以创建包含预定义任务、优先级和指派员工的新项目。与\\ "
"**排班**\\ 应用集成后，如果员工的有空时间与租赁期匹配，系统会自动排班并发布员"
"工班次。如适用，将优先考虑具有相关\\ :ref:`角色 <planning/planning-roles>`\\ "
"的员工。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:161
msgid "Create an invoice"
msgstr "创建发票"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:163
msgid ""
"Open the **Rental** app to display the *Rental Orders* dashboard. Click "
"the :guilabel:`To Invoice` smart button to view all rental orders that have "
"no invoices created for them."
msgstr ""
"打开\\ **租赁**\\ 应用以显示\\ *租赁订单*\\ 仪表板。点击\\ :guilabel:`待开"
