#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/orders_and_variants.rst:17
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "设置"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:36
msgid "The following apps are essential for the product kit workflow:"
msgstr "以下应用程序对于产品套件工作流程至关重要："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:38
msgid ""
"**Sales app**: Enables :ref:`connecting an Amazon Seller account to Odoo "
"<amazon/setup>`."
msgstr ""
"**销售应用**：启用\\ :ref:`将 Amazon 卖家账户连接到 Odoo <amazon/setup>`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:39
msgid ""
"**Inventory app**: Allows for product replenishment by :ref:`warehouse "
"location <use_locations/configuration>`."
msgstr ""
"**库存应用**：允许按\\ :ref:`仓库位置 <use_locations/configuration>`\\ 进行产"
"品补货。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:41
msgid ""
"**Manufacturing app**: Enables :ref:`BoM creation <manufacturing/basic_setup/"
"bom-setup>` for products and product kits."
msgstr ""
"**制造应用**：启用为产品和产品套件\\ :ref:`创建物料清单 <manufacturing/"
"basic_setup/bom-setup>`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:47
msgid "Create a product kit"
msgstr "创建产品套件"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:49
msgid ""
"To enable accurate tracking, create a product kit for the existing Amazon "
"product. When a new |FBA| order syncs, Odoo sells the kit, which prevents "
"the error that occurs with the tracked product."
msgstr ""
"为启用准确追踪，请为现有 Amazon 产品创建产品套件。当新的\\ |FBA|\\ 订单同步"
"时，Odoo 销售套件，这可以防止追踪产品发生错误。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:52
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Products --> Products` and "
"click :guilabel:`New`. Then, :ref:`create a kit as a product <manufacturing/"
"advanced_configuration/kits>` that represents the Amazon item."
msgstr ""
"导航至\\ :menuselection:`销售应用 --> 产品 --> 产品`\\ 并点击\\ :guilabel:`新"
"建`\\ 。然后\\ :ref:`创建套件作为产品 <manufacturing/advanced_configuration/"
"kits>`\\ 来代表 Amazon 商品。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:57
msgid "*Never* enable :guilabel:`Track Inventory` for the product kit."
msgstr "*切勿*为产品套件启用\\ :guilabel:`追踪库存`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:59
msgid "Example of a product form configured to be a kit in the Inventory app."
msgstr "在库存应用中配置为套件的产品表单示例。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:65
msgid "Link the Amazon item SKU to the product kit"
msgstr "将 Amazon 商品 SKU 关联到产品套件"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:67
msgid ""
"Next, go to the :menuselection:`Sales app --> Configuration --> Offers` and "
"click :guilabel:`New`. Enter the desired :ref:`Amazon market <amazon/"
"supported-marketplaces>` in the :guilabel:`Marketplace` column, and select "
"the product kit in the :guilabel:`Product` column. In the :guilabel:`Amazon "
"SKU` column, enter the SKU of the existing Amazon product."
msgstr ""
"接下来，转到\\ :menuselection:`销售应用 --> 配置 --> 报价`\\ 并点击"
"\\ :guilabel:`新建`\\ 。在\\ :guilabel:`市场`\\ 列中输入所需的"
"\\ :ref:`Amazon 市场 <amazon/supported-marketplaces>`\\ ，并在\\ :guilabel:`"
"产品`\\ 列中选择产品套件。在\\ :guilabel:`Amazon SKU`\\ 列中，输入现有 "
"Amazon 产品的 SKU。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:73
msgid ""
"This method removes the link between the Amazon SKU and the tracked product. "
"Breaking this connection is necessary because Odoo cannot automatically "
"assign specific tracking numbers during the sync process."
msgstr ""
"此方法删除 Amazon SKU 与追踪产品之间的关联。断开此连接是必要的，因为 Odoo 无"
"法在同步过程中自动分配特定的追踪编号。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:77
msgid ""
"Keeping this link active causes a synchronization failure for every |FBA| "
"order. By disconnecting them, the system bypasses the tracking requirement "
"and allows the sync to complete."
msgstr ""
"保持此关联活跃会导致每个\\ |FBA|\\ 订单的同步失败。通过断开它们，系统绕过追踪"
"要求并允许同步完成。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:80
msgid ""
"Example of a kit product linked to an Amazon SKU in the Offers page in the "
"Sales app."
msgstr "销售应用中报价页面中关联到 Amazon SKU 的套件产品示例。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:86
msgid "Create the BoM for the product kit"
msgstr "为产品套件创建物料清单"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:88
msgid ""
"Navigate to the product kit by clicking the :menuselection:`Sales app --> "
"Products --> Products` and select the product kit. Click the :icon:`fa-"
"flask` :guilabel:`Bill of Materials` smart button and :ref:`create a kit BoM "
"<manufacturing/advanced_configuration/kit-bom>`."
msgstr ""
"通过点击\\ :menuselection:`销售应用 --> 产品 --> 产品`\\ 导航到产品套件并选择"
"产品套件。点击\\ :icon:`fa-flask`\\ :guilabel:`物料清单`\\ 智能按钮并"
"\\ :ref:`创建套件物料清单 <manufacturing/advanced_configuration/kit-"
"bom>`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:92
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Components` tab, click :guilabel:`Add a line` and type in "
"the name of the Amazon product that is tracked by lots or a unique serial "
"number."
msgstr ""
"在\\ :guilabel:`组件`\\ 选项卡中，点击\\ :guilabel:`添加一行`\\ 并输入按批次"
"或唯一序列号追踪的 Amazon 产品名称。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:96
msgid "The Amazon product must be **the sole component** of the kit BoM."
msgstr "Amazon 产品必须是套件物料清单的**唯一组件**。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:98
msgid ""
"Example of the kit BoM for the kit product to represent the Amazon listing."
msgstr "用于表示 Amazon 清单的套装产品的套装 BoM 示例。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:101
msgid ""
"Now the Amazon product can be processed and tracked accurately in the "
"**Sales** app by using the kit product and its associated BoM."
msgstr ""
"现在可以通过使用套装产品及其关联的 BoM 在\\ **销售**\\ 应用中准确处理和跟踪 "
"Amazon 产品。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:3
msgid "Amazon Connector features"
msgstr "亚马逊连接器特点"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:5
msgid ""
"The *Amazon Connector* synchronizes orders between Amazon and Odoo, which "
"considerably reduces the amount of time spent manually entering Amazon "
"orders (from the Amazon Seller account) into Odoo. It also allows users to "
"accurately keep track of Amazon sales in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"*亚马逊连接器*可在亚马逊和 Odoo 之间同步订单，从而大大减少了将亚马逊订单（来"
"自亚马逊卖家账户）手动输入 Odoo 的时间。它还允许用户在 Odoo 中准确追踪亚马逊"
"的销售情况。"

