msgstr "SKU 参考编号"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/features.rst:20
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopee_connector/features.rst:18
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/features.rst:19
msgid "Quantity"
msgstr "数量"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/features.rst:22
msgid ""
"Synchronize (Odoo to Lazada) all available product quantities (:abbr:`FBM "
"(Fulfilled By Merchant)`)."
msgstr ""
"同步（从 Odoo 到 Lazada）所有可用产品数量（:abbr:`FBM（由商家履行）`）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/features.rst:25
msgid ""
"Synchronize the Lazada product catalog into Odoo or map existing Odoo "
"products to Lazada SKUs."
msgstr "将 Lazada 产品目录同步到 Odoo，或将现有 Odoo 产品映射到 Lazada SKU。"

