msgstr "同步所有已确认且未发货的订单。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/features.rst:35
msgid ""
"Managed by Lazada, and synchronized with a virtual location to track it in "
"Odoo."
msgstr "由 Lazada 管理，并与虚拟库位同步以在 Odoo 中跟踪。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/features.rst:35
msgid "Managed in Odoo Inventory app, and synchronized with Lazada."
msgstr "在 Odoo 库存应用中管理，并与 Lazada 同步。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/features.rst:40
msgid "Handled by Lazada."
msgstr "由 Lazada 处理。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/features.rst:40
msgid "Delivery information is fetched from Lazada, and synchronized in Odoo."
msgstr "配送信息从 Lazada 获取，并在 Odoo 中同步。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/features.rst:46
msgid ""
"The **Lazada Connector** is designed to synchronize sales orders and "
"inventory. Other actions, such as downloading monthly fee reports, handling "
"disputes, or issuing refunds, **must** be managed from the *Lazada Seller "
"Center*, as usual."
msgstr ""
"**Lazada 连接器**\\ 旨在同步销售订单和库存。其他操作（例如下载月费报告、处理"
"争议或发放退款）**必须**\\ 像往常一样从\\ *Lazada 卖家中心*\\ 进行管理。"

