"configure the options as follows:"
msgstr ""
"要创建充值产品，请进入 :menuselection:`销售应用程序 --> 产品 --> 产品` "
"并 :guilabel:`创建` 新产品。在产品模板上，配置选项如下："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/ewallets_giftcards.rst:32
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Product Name`: enter a name for the top-up product (for example, "
"`$50 Top-Up`)"
msgstr ":guilabel:`产品名称`：输入充值产品的名称（例如，`$50 充值`）。"

