"\\ :guilabel:`产品`\\ 页面上，点击\\ :icon:`fa-cog`\\ :guilabel:`操作`\\ 图标"
"并选择\\ :menuselection:`导入记录 --> 上传文件`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:219
msgid ""
