"联的\\ :guilabel:`相关属性`。这些属性可以拖放到所需的优先级顺序。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:154
msgid ""
"Attributes can be directly added to the category, as well, by "
"clicking :guilabel:`Add a line`."
msgstr "您也可以点击 :guilabel:`新增资料行`，将属性直接新增至类别。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:157
msgid ""
"To create an attribute category directly from this field, start typing the "
"name of the new category, then select either :guilabel:`Create` "
"or :guilabel:`Create and edit...` from the drop-down menu that appears."
msgstr ""
"若要直接在此字段内建立属性类别，您可开始输入新类别的名称，然后从显示的下拉式"
"功能表中，选择 :guilabel:`创建` 或 :guilabel:`创建并编辑⋯`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:161
msgid ""
"Clicking :guilabel:`Create` creates the category, which can be modified "
"later. Clicking :guilabel:`Create and edit...` creates the category and "
"reveals a :guilabel:`Create Category` pop-up window, in which the new "
"attribute category can be configured and customized."
msgstr ""
"点击 :guilabel:`创建` 即可建立类别，稍后可以进行修改。点击 :guilabel:`创建并"
"编辑⋯` 会创建类别，并即时显示 :guilabel:`建立类别` 弹出视窗，该处可配置及自订"
"新的属性类别。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:168
msgid "Attribute values"
msgstr "属性值"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:170
msgid ""
"Attribute values should be added in the *Attribute Values* tab. Values can "
"be added to an attribute at any time. To add a value, click :guilabel:`Add a "
"line` and enter the name of the value in the :guilabel:`Value` column."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:179
msgid ""
"Once an attribute is created, use the attribute (and its values) to create a "
"product variant. To do that, go to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Products --"
"> Products`, and select an existing product to view that desired product's "
"form. Or, click :guilabel:`Create` to create a new product, to which a "
"product variant can be added."
msgstr ""
"创建属性后，使用该属性（及其值）创建产品变体。为此，请转到\\ :menuselection:`"
"销售应用 --> 产品 --> 产品`，选择现有产品以查看所需产品的表单。或者，点击"
"\\ :guilabel:`创建`\\ 以创建新产品，然后可以为其添加产品变体。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:184
msgid ""
"On the product form, click the *Attributes \\& Variants* tab to view, "
"manage, and modify attributes and values for the product."
msgstr ""
"在产品表单上，点击\\ *属性与变体*\\ 选项卡，即可查看、管理和修改该产品的属性"
"及属性值。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:187
msgid "The attributes and values tab on a typical product form in Odoo Sales."
msgstr "Odoo 销售中典型产品表单上的属性和值选项卡。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:190
msgid ""
"To add an attribute to a product and subsequent attribute values, "
"click :guilabel:`Add a line` in the *Attributes \\& Variants* tab. Then, "
"choose the desired attribute from the drop-down menu that appears."
msgstr ""
"要向产品添加属性及后续属性值，请在\\ :guilabel:`属性与变体`\\ 选项卡中点击\\ "
":guilabel:`添加一行`。然后，从出现的下拉菜单中选择所需的属性。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:195
msgid ""
"Attributes can be created directly from the *Attributes \\& Variants* tab of "
"a product form. To do that, start typing the name of the new attribute in "
"the blank field, and select either :guilabel:`Create` or :guilabel:`Create "
"and edit...` from the mini drop-down menu that appears."
msgstr ""
"可以直接从产品表单的\\ :guilabel:`属性与变体`\\ 选项卡创建属性。为此，在空白"
"字段中开始输入新属性的名称，然后从出现的迷你下拉菜单中选择\\ :guilabel:`创"
"建`\\ 或\\ :guilabel:`创建并编辑...`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:199
msgid ""
"Clicking :guilabel:`Create` creates the attribute, which can be customized "
"later. Clicking :guilabel:`Create and edit...` creates the attribute, and "
"a :guilabel:`Create Attribute` pop-up form appears. In the pop-up form, "
"proceed to modify the attribute in a number of ways."
msgstr ""
"点击\\ :guilabel:`创建`\\ 会创建属性，稍后可以进行自定义。点击\\ :guilabel:`"
"创建并编辑...`\\ 会创建属性，并出现一个\\ :guilabel:`创建属性`\\ 弹出表单。在"
"弹出表单中，可以通过多种方式修改属性。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:203
msgid ""
"Once an attribute is selected in the :guilabel:`Attribute` column, proceed "
"to select the specific attribute values to apply to the product, via the "
"drop-down menu available in the :guilabel:`Values` column."
msgstr ""
"在\\ :guilabel:`属性`\\ 列中选择属性后，通过\\ :guilabel:`值`\\ 列中的下拉菜"
"单选择要应用于产品的特定属性值。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:208
msgid "There is no limit to how many values can be added."
msgstr "可以添加的值数量没有限制。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:211
msgid ""
"Similar product variant creation processes are accessible through the "
"Purchase, Inventory, and Similar product variant creation processes are "
"accessible through the **Purchase**, **Inventory**, and **eCommerce** "
"applications."
msgstr ""
"类似的产品变体创建流程可通过采购、库存，以及类似的产品变体创建流程可通过\\ "
"**采购**\\ 、\\ **库存**\\ 和\\ **电子商务**\\ 应用程序进行访问。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:218
msgid "Configure variants"
msgstr "配置款式变体"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:220
msgid ""
"On the attribute line is a :guilabel:`Configure` button. When clicked, Odoo "
"opens a separate page with that product's specific product "
"variant :guilabel:`Values`. The layout of this page may differ slightly from "
"what is pictured based on the apps, modules, and prior configurations of the "
"database."
msgstr ""
"属性行上有一个\\ :guilabel:`配置`\\ 按钮。点击后，Odoo 会打开一个单独的页面，"
"显示该产品特定的产品变体\\ :guilabel:`值`\\ 。根据数据库中的应用程序、模块和"
"先前的配置，此页面的布局可能与图示略有不同。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:227
msgid "Variants smart button"
msgstr "变体智能按钮"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:229
msgid ""
"When a product has attributes and variants configured in its *Attributes \\& "
"Variants* tab, a :icon:`fa-sitemap` :guilabel:`Variants` smart button "
"appears at the top of its product form. The :icon:`fa-"
"sitemap` :guilabel:`Variants` smart button indicates how many variants are "
"currently configured for that specific product. Using the smart button is "
"the primary way to access variants for products."
msgstr ""
"当产品在其\\ *属性与变体*\\ 选项卡中配置了属性和变体时，其产品表单顶部会出现"
"一个\\ :icon:`fa-sitemap` :guilabel:`变体`\\ 智能按钮。该\\ :icon:`fa-"
"sitemap` :guilabel:`变体`\\ 智能按钮会指示当前为该特定产品配置了多少个变体。"
"使用该智能按钮是访问产品变体的主要方式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:235
msgid "The variants smart button at the top of the product form in Odoo Sales."
msgstr "Odoo 销售应用中，产品表单顶部的“变体”智能按钮。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:238
msgid ""
"When the :icon:`fa-sitemap` :guilabel:`Variants` smart button is clicked, "
"Odoo reveals a separate page showcasing all the specific product variant "
"combinations configured for that specific product."
msgstr ""
"点击\\ :icon:`fa-sitemap` :guilabel:`变体`\\ 智能按钮后，Odoo 会打开一个单独"
"的页面，展示为该特定产品配置的所有具体产品变体组合。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:241
msgid ""
"The variants page accessible via the variants smart button on the product "
"form in Odoo."
msgstr "在 Odoo 中，通过产品表单上的“变体”智能按钮可访问的变体页面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:245
msgid "Impact of variants"
msgstr "变体的影响"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:247
msgid ""
"In addition to offering more detailed product options to customers, product "
"variants have their own impacts that can be taken advantage of throughout "
"the Odoo database."
msgstr ""
"除了为客户提供更详细的产品选项外，产品变体在 Odoo 数据库中还有其自身的影响"
"力，可以加以利用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:250
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Barcode`: barcodes are associated with each variant, instead of "
"the product template. Each individual variant can have its own unique "
"barcode/SKU."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`条形码`：条形码与每个变体关联，而不是与产品模板关联。每个独立的变"
"体都可以有自己独特的条形码/SKU（库存单位）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:252
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Price`: every product variant has its own public price, which is "
"the sum of the product template price *and* any extra charges for particular "
"attributes."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`价格`：每个产品变体都有其自己的公开价格，该价格是产品模板价格与特"
"定属性额外费用的总和。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:256
msgid ""
"A red shirt's sales price is $23 -- because the shirt's template price is "
"$20, plus an additional $3 for the red color variant. Pricelist rules can be "
"configured to apply to the product template. A red shirt's sales price is "
"$23 -- because the shirt's template price is $20, plus an additional $3 for "
"the red color variant. Pricelist rules can be configured to apply to the "
"product template or to the variant."
msgstr ""
"一件红色衬衫的销售价格为 23 美元——因为衬衫的模板价格为 20 美元，红色变体需额"
"外增加 3 美元。价格表规则可配置为应用于产品模板。一件红色衬衫的销售价格为 23 "
"美元——因为衬衫的模板价格为 20 美元，红色变体需额外增加 3 美元。价格表规则可配"
"置为应用于产品模板或变体。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:262
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Inventory`: Inventory is counted for each individual product "
"variant. On the product template form, the inventory reflects the sum of all "
"variants, but the actual inventory is computed by individual variants."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`库存`：库存按每个单独的产品变体计数。在产品模板表单上，库存反映所"
"有变体的总和，但实际库存是按单个变体计算的。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:265
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Manufacturing`: a single BoM can be used for multiple variants of "
"the same product."
msgstr ":guilabel:`制造`\\ ：单个物料清单可用于同一产品的多个变体。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:266
msgid ""
"Refer to :doc:`../../../../inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/"
"advanced_configuration/product_variants` documentation for more information."
msgstr ""
"有关更多信息，请参阅\\ :doc:`../../../../inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/"
"advanced_configuration/product_variants`\\ 文档。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:269
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Picture`: each product variant can have its own specific picture."
msgstr ":guilabel：`图片`：每个产品变体都可以有特定图片。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:272
msgid ""
"Changes to the product template automatically apply to every variant of that "
"product."
msgstr "对产品模板的更改将自动应用于产品的所有变体。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:275
msgid "Adding and deleting attributes from product variants"
msgstr "在产品变体中添加和删除属性"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:277
msgid ""
"When attributes are added or deleted from products, variants that have "
"already been created are affected. Depending on whether or not these "
"variants have been used in orders, they are archived or deleted and "
"recreated."
msgstr ""
"当在产品中添加或删除属性时，已创建的变体会受到影响。根据这些变体是否已在订单"
"中使用，它们将被归档或删除并重新创建。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:281
msgid ""
"Variants that have not been used in an order are deleted and recreated with "
"the new attributes. This may result in the deletion of additional "
"customizations, depending on how the variants were configured."
msgstr ""
"未在订单中使用过的变体将被删除并使用新属性重新创建。这可能导致删除其他自定义"
"设置，具体取决于变体的配置方式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:284
msgid ""
"Variants that have been previously used in one or more orders are archived "
"and removed from the product catalog instead of being deleted."
msgstr ""
"之前已在一个或多个订单中使用过的变体将被归档并从产品目录中移除，而不是被删"
"除。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:288
msgid ""
"A business offers leather motorcycle jackets with the following attributes "
"and values for a total of 27 product variants:"
msgstr "一家企业提供皮革摩托车夹克，具有以下属性和值，共计 27 个产品变体："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:291
msgid "Size: Small, Medium, Large"
msgstr "尺寸：小、中、大"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:292
msgid "Color: Black, Brown, Natural"
msgstr "颜色：黑色、棕色、原色"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:293
msgid "Material: Leather, Vegan Leather, Premium Leather"
msgstr "材质：皮革、纯素皮革、高级皮革"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:295
msgid ""
"Due to rising costs, the business makes the decision to stop offering "
"different leathers and removes the \"Material\" attribute from the product "
"form. This has the following effects:"
msgstr ""
"由于成本上涨，该企业决定停止提供不同的皮革，并从产品表单中移除\"材质\"属性。"
"这将产生以下影响："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:298
msgid "Any leather jacket variants that have been sold will be archived"
msgstr "任何已售出的皮夹克变体将被归档"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:299
msgid "Any leather jacket variants that have not been sold will be deleted"
msgstr "任何未售出的皮夹克变体将被删除"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:300
msgid ""
"A new set of variants using just Size and Color attributes will be created, "
"for a total of 9 product variants"
msgstr "将仅使用尺寸和颜色属性创建一组新变体，共计 9 个产品变体"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:303
msgid ""
"The business owner can find archived product variants by navigating to the "
"product's form, clicking the :icon:`fa-sitemap` :guilabel:`Variants` smart "
"button, clicking the drop-down in the search bar, and finally clicking "
"the :guilabel:`Archived` tag in the :icon:`fa-filter`. The business owner "
"can find archived product variants by navigating to the product's form and "
"clicking the :icon:`fa-sitemap` :guilabel:`Variants` smart button. On the "
"*Variants* page, click the drop-down in the search bar, then click "
"the :guilabel:`Archived` tag in the :icon:`fa-filter` :guilabel:`Variants`. "
"Any deleted variants and their customizations will be lost."
msgstr ""
"企业主可以通过以下方式查找已归档的产品变体：导航至产品表单，点击\\ :icon:`fa-"
"sitemap` :guilabel:`变体`\\ 智能按钮，点击搜索栏中的下拉菜单，最后点击\\ "
":guilabel:`已归档`\\ 标签（在\\ :icon:`fa-filter`\\ 下）。企业主可以通过导航"
"至产品表单并点击\\ :icon:`fa-sitemap` :guilabel:`变体`\\ 智能按钮来查找已归档"
"的产品变体。在\\ *变体*\\ 页面上，点击搜索栏中的下拉菜单，然后点击\\ "
":guilabel:`已归档`\\ 标签（在\\ :icon:`fa-filter` :guilabel:`变体`\\ 下）。任"
"何已删除的变体及其自定义设置都将丢失。"

