msgstr ":doc:`import`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:3
msgid "Returns and refunds"
msgstr "退货和退款"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:5
msgid ""
"The Odoo *Sales* app provides two different ways to process returns. The "
"method used depends on whether or not an invoice has been sent."
msgstr ""
"Odoo\\ *销售*\\ 应用提供两种不同的方式来处理退货。使用的方法取决于是否已发送"
"发票。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:11
msgid "Before invoicing"
msgstr "开票前"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:13
msgid ""
"Returns are completed using *Reverse Transfers* when a customer decides to "
"return a product **before** an invoice has been sent or validated."
msgstr ""
"当客户决定在发票发送或验证\\ **之前**\\ 退货时，使用\\ *反向调拨*\\ 完成退"
"货。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:17
msgid ""
"In order to use *Reverse Transfers*, the *Inventory* app **must** be "
"installed."
msgstr "要使用\\ *反向调拨*，\\ **必须**\\ 安装\\ *库存*\\ 应用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:19
msgid ""
"To start a return before invoicing, navigate to the :menuselection:`Sales` "
"app, select the desired sales order, and click on the :guilabel:`Delivery` "
"smart button to open the associated delivery order."
msgstr ""
"要在开票前开始退货，请导航至\\ :menuselection:`销售`\\ 应用，选择所需的销售订"
"单，然后点击\\ :guilabel:`交付`\\ 智能按钮以打开相关的交付订单。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:23
msgid ""
"A typical sales order with a highlighted delivery smart button in Odoo Sales."
msgstr ""
"Odoo\\ :guilabel:`销售`\\ 中典型的销售订单，其中突出显示了交付智能按钮。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:27
msgid "On the validated delivery order, click :guilabel:`Return`."
msgstr "在已确认的交付订单上，点击\\ :guilabel:`退货`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:29
msgid ""
"A validated delivery order with a highlighted Return button in Odoo Sales."
msgstr "Odoo\\ :guilabel:`销售`\\ 中已确认的交付订单，其中突出显示了退货按钮。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:33
msgid "This opens a :guilabel:`Reverse Transfer` pop-up window."
msgstr "这将打开\\ :guilabel:`反向调拨`\\ 弹出窗口。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:35
msgid ""
"By default, the :guilabel:`Quantity` matches the validated quantities from "
"the delivery order. Update the quantities, if necessary. Click on "
"the :guilabel:`🗑️ (trash)` icon next to a line item to remove it from the "
"return."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，\\ :guilabel:`数量`\\ 与交付订单中的已确认数量相匹配。如有必要，"
"请更新数量。点击行项目旁边的\\ :guilabel:`🗑️（垃圾桶）`\\ 图标可将其从退货中移"
"除。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:39
msgid ""
"The \"Reverse Transfer\" pop-up window, to make a return before invoicing "
"the customer."
msgstr "\"反向调拨\"弹出窗口，用于在向客户开票之前进行退货。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:43
msgid ""
"Next, click :guilabel:`Return` to confirm the return. This generates a new "
"warehouse operation for the incoming returned product(s)."
msgstr ""
"接下来，点击\\ :guilabel:`退货`\\ 以确认退货。这将为退回的产品生成新的仓库操"
"作。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:46
msgid "Warehouse operation after a return has been confirmed in Odoo Sales."
msgstr "在Odoo\\ :guilabel:`销售`\\ 中确认退货后的仓库操作。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:50
msgid ""
"Upon receiving the return, the warehouse team validates the warehouse "
"operation by clicking :guilabel:`Validate`. Then, on the original sales "
"order, the :guilabel:`Delivered` quantity updates to reflect the difference "
"between the initial validated quantities and the returned quantities."
msgstr ""
"收到退货后，仓库团队通过点击\\ :guilabel:`确认`\\ 来确认仓库操作。然后，在原"
"始销售订单上，\\ :guilabel:`已交付`\\ 数量会更新，以反映初始已确认数量与退货"
"数量之间的差异。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:54
msgid ""
"The updated \"Delivered\" quantity on the sales order after the reverse "
"transfer."
msgstr "反向调拨后销售订单上更新的\"已交付\"数量。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:58
msgid ""
"When an invoice is created, the customer receives an invoice **only** for "
"the products they are keeping, if any."
msgstr "创建发票时，客户仅会收到保留产品（如有）的发票。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:64
msgid "After invoicing"
msgstr "开票后"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:66
msgid ""
"Sometimes, customers return an item after they receive and/or pay for their "
"invoice. In these cases, a return using only *Reverse Transfers* is "
"insufficient since validated, or sent, invoices cannot be changed."
msgstr ""
"有时，客户会在收到和/或支付发票后退货。在这种情况下，仅使用*反向调拨*是不够"
"的，因为已确认或已发送的发票无法更改。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:70
msgid ""
"However, *Reverse Transfers* can be used in conjunction with *Credit Notes* "
"to complete the customer's return."
msgstr "但是，*反向调拨*可以与*信用凭证*结合使用，以完成客户的退货。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:73
msgid ""
"To start a return after invoicing, navigate to the relevant sales order in "
"the :menuselection:`Sales` app."
msgstr ""
"要在开票后开始退货，请导航至\\ :menuselection:`销售`\\ 应用中的相关销售订单。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:76
msgid ""
"If there is a payment registered on the sales order, the payment details "
"appear in the chatter, and the invoice (accessible through "
"the :guilabel:`Invoices` smart button) has a green :guilabel:`In Payment` "
"banner."
msgstr ""
"如果销售订单上记录了付款，付款详细信息会显示在聊天记录中，并且发票（可通过"
"\\ :guilabel:`发票`\\ 智能按钮访问）会显示绿色的\\ :guilabel:`付款中`\\ 横"
"幅。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:80
msgid "Sample of a green in payment banner in Odoo Sales."
msgstr "Odoo\\ :guilabel:`销售`\\ 中绿色付款中横幅的示例。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:84
msgid ""
"From the sales order, click on the :guilabel:`Delivery` smart button to view "
"the validated delivery order. Then, click :guilabel:`Return` to open "
"the :guilabel:`Reverse Transfer` pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"在销售订单中，点击 :guilabel:`送货` 智能按钮，查看已验证的送货订单。然后，点"
"击 :guilabel:`退货` 弹出 :guilabel:`逆向转移` 窗口。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:87
msgid ""
"Next, edit the :guilabel:`Product` and/or :guilabel:`Quantity`, as needed "
"for the return. Then, click :guilabel:`Return`. This generates a new "
"warehouse operation for the incoming returned product(s), which is validated "
"by the warehouse team once the return is received by "
"clicking :guilabel:`Validate`."
msgstr ""
"然后，根据退货的需要编辑 :guilabel:`产品` 和/或 :guilabel:`数量`。然后，点"
"击 :guilabel:`退货`。这将为收到的退货产品生成一个新的仓库操作，一旦收到退货，"
"点击 :guilabel:`验证` 即可由仓库团队进行验证。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:92
msgid ""
"Then, on the sales order, the :guilabel:`Delivered` quantity updates to "
"reflect the difference between the initial validated quantities and the "
"returned quantities."
msgstr ""
"然后，在销售订单上，更新 :guilabel:`已送达` 数量，以反映初始验证数量和退回数"
"量之间的差额。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:95
msgid ""
"To process a refund, navigate to the relevant invoice (from the sales order, "
"click on the :guilabel:`Invoices` smart button). Then, click "
"the :guilabel:`Credit Note` button at the top of the validated invoice."
msgstr ""
"要处理退款，请导航至相关发票（从销售订单点击 :guilabel:`发票` 智能按钮）。然"
"后，点击已验证发票顶部的 :guilabel:`贷记单` 按钮。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:99
msgid ""
"A typical customer invoice with a Credit Note button highlighted in Odoo "
"Sales."
msgstr "Odoo 销售系统中的常规客户发票，突出显示贷记单按钮。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:103
msgid "Doing so reveals a :guilabel:`Credit Note` pop-up form."
msgstr "这样做会弹出 :guilabel:`贷记单` 表单。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:105
msgid "Typical credit note pop-up form that appears in Odoo Sales."
msgstr "Odoo 销售系统中出现的常规贷记单弹出窗口。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:109
msgid ""
"Start by entering a :guilabel:`Reason displayed on Credit Note` and a "
"specific :guilabel:`Journal` to process the credit. Then, select a "
"specific :guilabel:`Reversal Date`."
msgstr ""
"首先输入 :guilabel:`贷记单上显示的原因` 和特定的 :guilabel:`日记账` 来处理贷"
"记。然后，选择特定的 :guilabel:`逆转日期`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:112
msgid ""
"After the information is filled in, click :guilabel:`Reverse` "
"or :guilabel:`Reverse and Create Invoice`. Then, edit the draft, if needed."
msgstr ""
"填写信息后，点击 :guilabel:`逆转` 或 :guilabel:`逆转和创建发票`。然后，根据需"
"要编辑草稿。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:115
msgid "Lastly, click :guilabel:`Confirm` to confirm the credit note."
msgstr "最后，点击 :guilabel:`确认`，以确认贷记单。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:117
msgid ""
"When complete, a blue banner reading: :guilabel:`You have outstanding "
"credits for this customer. You can allocate them to mark this invoice as "
"paid.` appears at the top of the page."
msgstr ""
"完成后，页面顶部会出现一个蓝色横幅： :guilabel:`您有该客户的未结贷项。您可直"
"接抵扣，以将此发票标记为已付清。`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:121
msgid ":doc:`../../../finance/accounting/customer_invoices/credit_notes`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../../finance/accounting/customer_invoices/credit_notes`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:122
msgid ""
":ref:`Handling returns through the customer portal <ecommerce/handling/"
"returns>`"
msgstr ":ref:`通过客户门户处理退货 <ecommerce/handling/returns>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:6
msgid "Sales quotations"
msgstr "销售报价单"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:8
msgid ""
"A *sales quotation* or quote is a document sent to a customer that outlines "
"the estimated costs and terms for goods and services. Once accepted, a "
"quotation can be converted into a sales order, which serves as the final "
"agreement before delivery and invoicing."
msgstr ""
"*销售报价单*（或简称“报价单”）是一份发送给客户的文件，其中概述了商品和服务的"
"预估成本及相关条款。一旦客户接受，报价单便可转换为销售订单，作为后续交付和开"
"具发票前的最终协议。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:13
msgid "Sales flow overview"
msgstr "销售流程概览"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:15
msgid ""
"Quotations fit into a broader sales flow that connects different stages of "
"customer interactions from initial interest to payment."
msgstr ""
"报价单是整个销售流程中的关键一环，该流程连接了从客户产生初步意向到最终完成付"
"款的各个交互阶段。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:18
msgid "The typical flow follows these steps:"
msgstr "典型的流程包含以下步骤："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:20
msgid ""
"*Quotation*: A proposal sent to the customer with product details and "
"pricing."
msgstr "*报价单*：发送给客户的提案，包含产品详情和定价。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:21
msgid ""
"*Sales order*: Created automatically when the customer accepts the "
"quotation, confirming the sale."
msgstr "*销售订单*：客户接受报价单后自动创建，用以正式确认销售。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:23
msgid ""
"*Delivery* (if applicable): Products are shipped or services are delivered."
msgstr "*交付*（如适用）：发出实体产品或提供所需服务。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:24
msgid ""
"*Invoice*: The final bill is issued based on the sales order or delivered "
"products/services."
msgstr "*发票*：根据销售订单或已交付的产品/服务开具的最终账单。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:25
msgid ""
"*Payment*: The customer settles the invoice, completing the sales cycle."
msgstr "*付款*：客户结清发票款项，完成整个销售周期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:27
msgid ""
"This flow helps businesses track the entire lifecycle of a sale while "
"keeping information consistent across apps."
msgstr ""
"该流程有助于企业追踪销售的全生命周期，同时保持信息在不同应用间的一致性。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:30
msgid ""
"In Odoo, quotations are configured in the **Sales** app. They can also be "
"generated from other apps as part of the sales workflow:"
msgstr ""
"在 Odoo 中，报价单主要在**销售**应用中进行配置。同时，它们也可以作为完整销售"
"工作流的一部分，从其他应用中生成："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:33
msgid ""
"**CRM**: :doc:`Convert opportunities <../crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes>` "
"into quotes to follow up on potential deals."
msgstr ""
"**客户关系管理**：:doc:`将商机转换为报价单 <../crm/acquire_leads/"
"send_quotes>`，以跟进潜在的交易。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:35
msgid ""
"**Helpdesk**: :doc:`Generate quotes from tickets <../../services/helpdesk/"
"advanced/after_sales>` when offering paid services or products."
msgstr ""
"**服务台**：在提供额外付费服务或产品时，:doc:`从支持工单生成报价单 <../../"
"services/helpdesk/advanced/after_sales>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:37
msgid ""
"**Subscriptions**: :doc:`Offer recurring services <../subscriptions>` before "
"starting an automatic billing cycle."
msgstr ""
"**订阅**：在启动自动计费周期前，用于 :doc:`提供订阅式服务 <../"
"subscriptions>` 的报价。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:42
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:8
msgid "Create quotations"
msgstr "创建报价单"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:42
msgid "Create, configure, and send quotations to customers."
msgstr "创建、配置并向客户发送报价单。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:47
msgid "Quotation templates"
msgstr "报价模板"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:47
msgid ""
"Configure and use quotation templates to send tailor-fit quotations at a "
"quicker pace."
msgstr "配置和使用报价模板，以更快的速度发送量身定制的报价单。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:52
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/optional_products.rst:3
msgid "Optional products"
msgstr "可选产品"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:52
msgid "Offer useful and related products to customers to increase sales."
msgstr "向客户提供有用的相关产品以增加销售额。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:57
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/get_signature_to_validate.rst:3
msgid "Online signatures for order confirmations"
msgstr "订单确认的在线签名"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:57
msgid ""
"Customers have the ability to confirm orders via online signatures, directly "
"on sales orders."
msgstr "客户可以直接在销售订单上通过在线签名确认订单。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:62
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/get_paid_to_validate.rst:3
msgid "Online payment order confirmation"
msgstr "在线支付订单确认"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:62
msgid ""
"Customers have the ability to confirm orders via online payment, directly on "
"sales orders."
msgstr "客户可以直接在销售订单上通过在线支付确认订单。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:67
msgid "Quotation Deadlines"
msgstr "报价期限"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:67
msgid ""
"Set deadlines on quotations to encourage customers to act in a timely manner "
"when closing business deals."
msgstr "在报价单上设置期限，以鼓励客户在达成业务交易时及时采取行动。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:73
msgid "Deliver orders and invoices to different addresses"
msgstr "将订单和发票交付到不同地址"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:73
msgid ""
"Specify separate customer delivery and invoicing addresses on quotations."
msgstr "在报价单上指定单独的客户交付地址和发票地址。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:78
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/orders_and_variants.rst:3
msgid "Product variants on quotations and sales orders"
msgstr "报价单和销售订单上的产品变体"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:78
msgid ""
"Add product variants to sales orders to provide additional options for "
"single products."
msgstr "将产品变体添加到销售订单，为单个产品提供额外选项。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:83
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder.rst:6
msgid "PDF quote builder"
msgstr "PDF 报价生成器"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:83
msgid ""
"Add custom PDF files to quotations to elevate the document's headers and "
"designs."
msgstr "将自定义PDF文件添加到报价单，以提升文档的页眉和设计。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:89
msgid "Sales quotations in business deals"
msgstr "商业交易中的销售报价单"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:91
msgid ""
"Sales quotations serve as a key step in the sales process, bridging the gap "
"between a customer's initial inquiry about goods and services and the final "
"contractual agreement for payment and delivery. The quotation also provides "
"transparency in pricing, helping both parties negotiate and finalize the "
"terms before making a commitment."
msgstr ""
"销售报价单是销售流程中的关键一步，它连接了客户对商品和服务的初步询价与最终的"
"付款交付合同协议。同时，报价单也提供了定价的透明度，有助于买卖双方在做出承诺"
"前协商并敲定具体条款。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:96
msgid ""
"Sales quotations play a crucial role in business transactions by defining "
"the scope and cost of what is being sold to the end-customer; setting clear "
"expectations on pricing, delivery, tax, and payment terms; and providing a "
"documented stage where the business deal can be negotiated before agreed "
"upon."
msgstr ""
"通过明确销售给最终客户的产品/服务范围和成本、设定清晰的定价/交付/税务和付款条"
"款预期，并提供一个在达成协议前可供协商的书面凭证，销售报价单在商业交易中扮演"
"着至关重要的角色。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:102
msgid "Key components of a sales quotation"
msgstr "销售报价单的关键组成部分"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:104
msgid "A well-structured sales quotation comprises the following:"
msgstr "一份结构完善的销售报价单通常包含以下要素："

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:106
msgid ""
"Quotation number and date: A unique identifier for tracking and reference, "
"as well as the :doc:`dates of issue and expiration <sales_quotations/"
"deadline>`. In Odoo **Sales** app, the quotation number is assigned under a "
"standard naming convention once it is confirmed."
msgstr ""
"报价单编号和日期：用于追踪和参考的唯一标识符，以及 :doc:`开具日期和失效日期 "
"<sales_quotations/deadline>`。在 Odoo **销售**应用中，报价单一旦被确认，系统"
"便会按标准命名规则为其分配编号。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:109
msgid ""
"Customer information: Customer name and contact information, as well "
"as :doc:`invoicing and delivery address <sales_quotations/"
"different_addresses>`."
msgstr ""
"客户信息：客户名称、联系信息，以及 :doc:`开票地址和送货地址 "
"<sales_quotations/different_addresses>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:111
msgid ""
"Products and services: Itemized listing of items to be purchased, including "
"quantity, specifications (as needed), and unit price."
msgstr "产品和服务：待购项目的明细列表，包括数量、规格（如需）和单价。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:113
msgid ""
"Payment terms and :doc:`pricelists <products_prices/prices/pricing>`: "
"Configured agreements and rules for the pricing and payment of this "
"particular sales quotation."
msgstr ""
"付款条款和 :doc:`价目表 <products_prices/prices/pricing>`：为该销售报价单特别"
"配置的定价、付款协议及规则。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:115
msgid ""
"Special pricing: Optional :doc:`discounts and promotional pricing "
"<products_prices/prices/pricing>` to update and/or modify individual product "
"lines."
msgstr ""
"特殊定价：可选的 :doc:`折扣和促销定价 <products_prices/prices/pricing>`，用于"
"更新或修改单个产品行的价格。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:117
msgid ""
"Total cost and currency: Summary totals of product or service and shipping "
"prices, including relevant taxes."
msgstr "总成本和币种：产品/服务及运费的总计摘要，并包含所有相关税费。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:120
msgid ""
"In Odoo's **Sales** app, quotations can include additional details and "
"configurations that add more detail and information, such as :doc:`quotation "
"templates <sales_quotations/quote_template>`, :doc:`subscription plans "
"<../../sales/subscriptions>`, and :doc:`sales team referrer name "
"<sales_quotations/create_quotations>`."
msgstr ""
"在 Odoo 的**销售**应用中，报价单还可以包含更多详细信息和高级配置，例如 :doc:`"
"报价单模板 <sales_quotations/quote_template>`、:doc:`订阅计划 <../../sales/"
"subscriptions>`，以及 :doc:`销售团队及推荐人信息 <sales_quotations/"
"create_quotations>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:125
msgid "Unconfirmed sales quotation in Odoo **Sales** app."
msgstr "Odoo **销售**应用中一张未确认状态的销售报价单。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:-1
msgid ""
"Explains how to configure quotation settings, create a quotation and fill in "
"its Order Lines, Optional Products, and Other Info tabs, and send it to a "
"customer for confirmation."
msgstr ""
"说明如何配置报价设置、创建报价单并填写其“订单明细”、“可选产品”和“其他信息”标"
"签页，并发送给客户进行确认。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:10
msgid ""
"In Odoo **Sales**, quotations can be created and sent to customers. Once a "
"quotation has been confirmed, it officially turns into a *sales order*, "
"which can then be invoiced and paid for."
msgstr ""
"在 Odoo **销售**应用中，用户可以创建报价单并将其发送给客户。一旦报价单被确"
"认，它将正式转变为*销售订单*，之后便可据此开具发票并完成付款。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:18
msgid ""
"To access these setting options, navigate to :menuselection:`Sales app --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`, and scroll to the :guilabel:`Quotations & "
"Orders` section."
msgstr ""
"要访问这些设置选项，请前往 :menuselection:`销售应用` --> 配置 --> 设置`，然后"
"找到 :guilabel:`报价单和订单`部分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:21
msgid "The Quotations and Orders section on the Odoo Sales app Settings page."
msgstr "Odoo 销售应用“设置”页面中的“报价单和订单”部分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:24
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Mandatory Product`: Prevents sales without a linked product from "
"being completed."
msgstr ":guilabel:`必选产品`：阻止在未关联产品的情况下完成销售。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:25
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Online Signature`: Requests an online signature by default to "
"validate orders. This may be changed on individual orders."
msgstr ":guilabel:`在线签名`：默认要求在线签名以确认订单。这可以在单个订单上更改。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:27
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Online Payment`: Requests online prepayment from customers to "
"confirm orders. The payment may be full or partial. When this option is "
"active, an additional field (:guilabel:`Payment X %`) appears. A demo with "
"the current payment provider may be configured by clicking "
"the :guilabel:`Configure Demo` button. Other providers may be selected by "
"clicking :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`View Other Providers`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`在线支付`：默认要求客户进行在线预付款以确认订单。付款可以是全额或"
"部分款项。当此选项启用时，将出现一个附加字段（:guilabel:`支付 X %`）。点击\\ "
":guilabel:`配置演示`\\ 按钮，可以配置当前支付服务商的演示模式。也可以通过点"
"击\\ :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`查看其他服务商`\\ 来选择其他服务商。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:32
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Default Quotation Validity`: Determines a set amount "
"(in :guilabel:`days`) that quotations remain valid for. This default may be "
"changed per order."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`默认报价有效期`：设置报价单保持有效的一定时长（以\\ :guilabel:`天"
"数`\\ 为单位）。此默认值可在每个订单中分别更改。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:34
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Sale Warnings`: Issues warning messages to database users about "
"orders that include specific products or customers."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`销售警告`：向数据库用户发出关于包含特定产品或客户的订单的警告消息"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:36
msgid ""
":guilabel:`PDF Quote builder`: Customizes the look of quotations with header "
"pages, product descriptions, footer pages, and more."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`PDF 报价单构建器`：通过自定义页眉、产品描述、页脚等内容，个性化报"
"价单的外观。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:38
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Display Product Images`: Allows product images to be displayed on "
"PDFs and online quotations."
msgstr ":guilabel:`显示产品图片`：允许在 PDF 和在线报价单上显示产品图片。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:40
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Lock Confirmed Sales`: Ensures that orders cannot be edited once "
"confirmed."
msgstr ":guilabel:`锁定已确认销售`：确保订单一旦确认便无法再进行编辑。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:41
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Pro-Forma Invoice`: Allows pro-forma invoices to be sent to "
"customers ahead of regular invoices."
msgstr ":guilabel:`形式发票`：允许在开具正式发票之前向客户发送形式发票。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:44
msgid ""
"To activate any of these settings, click the checkbox beside the desired "
"options. Then, click :guilabel:`Save`. The values set in "
"the :guilabel:`Online Signature`, :guilabel:`Online "
"Payment`, :guilabel:`Default Quotation Validity`, and :guilabel:`Display "
"Product Images` fields are company-specific. In a multi-company database, "
"these must be set for each individual company."
msgstr ""
"如需启用上述任何设置，请勾选所需选项旁的复选框。然后，点击\\ :guilabel:`保"
"存`\\ 。在\\ :guilabel:`在线签名`\\ 、\\ :guilabel:`在线支付`\\ 、\\ "
":guilabel:`默认报价有效期`\\ 以及\\ :guilabel:`显示产品图片`\\ 字段中设置的值"
"区分公司。在多公司数据库中，必须为每个单独的公司分别进行设置。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:52
msgid "Quotations dashboard"
msgstr "报价单仪表板"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:54
msgid ""
"The *Quotations* dashboard is the page that appears when "
"the :menuselection:`Sales app` is opened."
msgstr "*报价单*仪表板是在打开 :menuselection:`销售应用`时默认显示的页面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:56
msgid ""
"By default, the :guilabel:`Quotations` dashboard displays all quotations in "
"the database related to the current user, as indicated by the "
"default :guilabel:`My Quotations` filter present in the search bar."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，:guilabel:`报价单`仪表板会显示数据库中与当前用户相关的所有报价"
"单，这通过搜索栏中默认存在的 :guilabel:`我的报价单`筛选器来实现。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:60
msgid "The Quotations dashboard present in the Odoo Sales application."
msgstr "Odoo 销售应用中的“报价单”仪表板。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:64
msgid ""
"To view *all* quotations in the database, remove the :guilabel:`My "
"Quotations` filter from the search bar."
msgstr ""
"要查看数据库中的*所有*报价单，只需从搜索栏中移除 :guilabel:`我的报价单`筛选器"
"即可。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:67
msgid ""
"Quotations on this page appear in a default list view, but can also be "
"viewed in a :icon:`oi-view-kanban` :guilabel:`Kanban` view, :icon:`fa-"
"calendar` :guilabel:`Calendar`, :icon:`oi-view-pivot` :guilabel:`Pivot` "
"table, :icon:`fa-area-chart` :guilabel:`Graph`, or :icon:`fa-clock-"
"o` :guilabel:`Activity` view."
msgstr ""
"此页面上的报价单默认以列表视图显示，但也可以切换为 :icon:`oi-view-"
"kanban` :guilabel:`看板`视图、:icon:`fa-calendar` :guilabel:`日历`视"
"图、:icon:`oi-view-pivot` :guilabel:`数据透视`表、:icon:`fa-area-"
"chart` :guilabel:`图表`或 :icon:`fa-clock-o` :guilabel:`活动`视图。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:72
msgid ""
"To view or modify any listed quotation from the :guilabel:`Quotations` "
"dashboard, click on the desired quotation line from the list, and Odoo "
"reveals the specific form for that selected quotation."
msgstr ""
"要查看或修改**报价单**仪表板上列出的任一报价单，只需点击列表中的相应条目，"
"Odoo 便会跳转至该报价单的具体表单页面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:79
msgid "Create a quotation"
msgstr "创建报价单"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:81
msgid ""
"To create a quotation, open the :menuselection:`Sales app`, and click "
"the :guilabel:`New` button, located in the upper-left corner of the "
"main :guilabel:`Quotations` dashboard."
msgstr ""
"要创建报价单，请打开 :menuselection:`销售应用`，然后点击 :guilabel:`报价单`主"
"仪表板左上角的 :guilabel:`新建`按钮。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:85
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`New` button is **only** present if the :guilabel:`Quotations` "
"dashboard is in list or Kanban view."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`新建`按钮**仅**在 :guilabel:`报价单`仪表板处于列表或看板视图时才会"
"显示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:88
msgid ""
"Clicking the :guilabel:`New` button reveals a blank quotation form, with "
"various fields and tabs to configure."
msgstr ""
"点击 :guilabel:`新建`按钮后，系统会展示一个空白的报价单表单，其中包含多个待配"
"置的字段和选项卡。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:91
msgid ""
"Begin by entering the customer's name in the :guilabel:`Customer` field at "
"the top of the form. This is a **required** field."
msgstr ""
"首先，在表单顶部的 :guilabel:`客户`字段中输入客户名称。这是一个必填字段。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:94
msgid ""
"If the customer's information is already in the database, "
"the :guilabel:`Invoice Address` and :guilabel:`Delivery Address` fields auto-"
"populate with the saved information for those respective fields, based on "
"the data from that customer's contact record (found in the **Contacts** "
"application)."
msgstr ""
"如果该客户的信息已存在于数据库中，系统将根据其联系人记录（可在联系人应用中找"
"到）中的数据，自动填充 :guilabel:`开票地址` 和 :guilabel:`送货地址`字段。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:99
msgid ""
"If the customer was referred by another customer or contact, enter their "
"name in the :guilabel:`Referrer` field."
msgstr ""
"如果该客户是由其他客户或联系人推荐的，请在 :guilabel:`推荐人`字段中输入其姓"
"名。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:102
msgid ""
"If a :guilabel:`Referrer` is selected, a new field, :guilabel:`Commission "
"Plan` appears, in which a commission can be selected from the drop-down "
"menu. This commission is rewarded to the contact selected in "
"the :guilabel:`Referrer` field."
msgstr ""
"选择 :guilabel:`推荐人`后，界面上会出现一个新的 :guilabel:`佣金计划`字段，您"
"可以从下拉菜单中选择一个佣金方案。该佣金将奖励给在 :guilabel:`推荐人`字段中选"
"定的联系人。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:106
msgid ""
"Next, if they have not already been auto-populated with the customer's "
"information, enter the appropriate addresses in the :guilabel:`Invoice "
"Address` and :guilabel:`Delivery Address` fields. Both of these fields are "
"**required**."
msgstr ""
"接下来，如果 :guilabel:`开票地址`和 :guilabel:`送货地址`字段未被自动填充，请"
"输入相应的地址。这两个字段均为**必填项**。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:110
msgid ""
"Then, if desired, choose a :guilabel:`Quotation Template` from the drop-down "
"field to apply to this quotation. It should be noted that some additional "
"fields may appear, depending on the template selected."
msgstr ""
"然后，如果需要，您可以从 :guilabel:`报价单模板`下拉字段中选择一个模板应用到此"
"报价单。请注意，根据所选模板的不同，表单上可能会出现一些额外的字段。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:114
msgid ""
"The default date that appears in the :guilabel:`Expiration` field is based "
"on the number configured in the :ref:`Default Quotation Validity setting "
"<sales/create_quotations/quotation-settings>` (in :menuselection:`Sales app "
"--> Configuration --> Settings`)."
msgstr ""
"在\\ :guilabel:`到期`\\ 字段中显示的默认日期基于在\\ :ref:`默认报价单有效期设"
"置 <sales/create_quotations/quotation-settings>`\\ （位于\\ "
":menuselection:`销售应用 --> 配置 --> 设置`\\ ）中配置的数值。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:119
msgid ""
"When using a quotation template, the date in the :guilabel:`Expiration` "
"field is based on the :guilabel:`Quotation Validity` figure on the template "
"form."
msgstr ""
"使用报价单模板时，\\ :guilabel:`到期`\\ 字段中的日期基于模板表单上的\\ "
":guilabel:`报价单有效期`\\ 数值。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:122
msgid ""
"If the quotation is for a recurring product or subscription, select the "
"desired :guilabel:`Recurring Plan` from that specific drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"如果报价单涉及重复性产品或订阅服务，请从相应的下拉菜单中选择所需"
"的 :guilabel:`订阅计划`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:125
msgid ""
"If desired, select a specific :guilabel:`Pricelist` to be applied to this "
"quotation."
msgstr "如果需要，可选择一个特定的 :guilabel:`价目表`应用于此报价单。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:127
msgid ""
"Lastly, select any specific :guilabel:`Payment Terms` to be used for this "
"quotation."
msgstr "最后，为此报价单选择任何特定的 :guilabel:`付款条款`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:130
msgid "Order Lines tab"
msgstr "订单明细选项卡"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:132
msgid ""
"The first tab on the quotation form is the *Order Lines* tab. In this tab, "
"products may be added to the quotation by the *Description* column or "
"through the *Product Catalog*."
msgstr ""
"报价单表单上的第一个选项卡是 *订单明细* 选项卡。在此选项卡中，可以通过 *说"
"明* 列或通过 *产品目录* 将产品添加到报价单中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:135
msgid ""
"To add a product using the *Description* column, type the product's name. If "
"it exists in the database, it appears as an autocomplete option and can be "
"clicked to configure as desired and added to the order. If the product does "
"not exist in the database, enter the desired name and relevant information "
"like quantity and price."
msgstr ""
"若要使用 *说明* 列添加产品，请输入产品名称。如果该产品存在于数据库中，将显示"
"为自动完成选项，点击即可根据需要进行配置并添加到订单中。如果该产品不存在于数"
"据库中，请输入所需名称以及数量和价格等相关信息。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:140
msgid ""
"The Description column in a quotation with both a manually added product and "
"the\n"
"autocomplete open."
msgstr "报价单中的“说明”列，同时显示手动添加的产品和打开的自动补全列表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:145
msgid ""
"Products added to sales quotations by manually entering a name and price are "
"**not** added to the database. They only exist on the quotation/sales order "
"where they were typed into the *Description* column."
msgstr ""
"通过手动输入名称和价格添加到销售报价单中的产品**不会**添加到数据库中。它们仅"
"存在于在 *说明* 列中输入它们的报价单/销售订单中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:149
msgid ""
"To add a product through the *Product Catalog*, click :guilabel:`Catalog` to "
"reveal a separate page showcasing every item and potential product variant "
"in an organized catalog display. Items can be organized "
"by :guilabel:`Product Category` and :guilabel:`Attributes`."
msgstr ""
"若要通过 *产品目录* 添加产品，请点击\\ :guilabel:`目录`\\ 打开单独页面，以有"
"条理的目录视图展示每个项目和潜在产品变体。项目可按\\ :guilabel:`产品类别`\\ "
"和\\ :guilabel:`属性`\\ 进行整理。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:153
msgid ""
"A product catalog accessible via a quotation in the Odoo Sales application."
msgstr "在 Odoo 销售应用中，可从报价单页面访问的产品目录。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:156
msgid ""
"From here, locate the desired items, click the :icon:`fa-shopping-"
"cart` :guilabel:`Add` button on the product card, and adjust the quantity, "
"if needed. When complete, click the :guilabel:`Back to Quotation` button in "
"the upper-left corner to return to the quotation, where the newly selected "
"catalog items can be found in the *Order Lines* tab."
msgstr ""
"在产品目录中，您只需找到所需商品，点击产品卡片上的 :icon:`fa-shopping-cart "
"`:guilabel:`添加`按钮，并按需调整数量。完成后，点击左上角的 :guilabel:`返回报"
"价单`按钮，即可返回报价单页面，此时新选择的商品已添加至 :guilabel:`订单明"
"细`选项卡中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:161
msgid ""
"If multiple items should be presented in a more organized way on the "
"quotation, click :guilabel:`Add a section`, enter a name for the section, "
"and drag-and-drop that section heading in the desired location amongst the "
"items in the :guilabel:`Order Lines` tab. The section heading appears in "
"bold and a sub-total for all products in a section is displayed. Then, if "
"desired, :ref:`add a Section Template <sales/quote_template/section-"
"templates>` to this quotation."
msgstr ""
"如果要在报价单上更有条理地呈现多个项目，请点击\\ :guilabel:`添加小节`，输入小"
"节名称，然后将该小节标题拖放到\\ :guilabel:`订单明细`\\ 选项卡中项目间的所需"
"位置。小节标题将以粗体显示，并显示该小节中所有产品的分类汇总。然后，根据需要"
"，为该报价单\\ :ref:`添加小节模板 <sales/quote_template/section-templates>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:167
msgid ""
"If needed, click :guilabel:`Add a note` beneath a certain product line to "
"add a custom note about that specific product. The note appears in italics. "
"Then, if needed, proceed to drag-and-drop the note beneath the desired "
"product line."
msgstr ""
"如果需要，可以点击某个产品行下方的 :guilabel:`添加备注`，为该特定产品添加自定"
"义备注。备注将以斜体显示。然后，可根据需要将备注拖放到相应的产品行下方。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:171
msgid ""
"Beneath the product lines, there are buttons that can be clicked to apply "
"any of the following: :guilabel:`Coupon "
"Code`, :guilabel:`Promotions`, :guilabel:`Discount`, and :guilabel:`Add "
"shipping`."
msgstr ""
"在所有产品行的下方，您可以点击按钮以应用以下任一选项：:guilabel:`优惠券代"
"码`、:guilabel:`促销活动`、:guilabel:`折扣` 和/或 :guilabel:`添加运费`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:175
msgid ":doc:`../products_prices/ewallets_giftcards`"
msgstr ":doc:`../products_prices/ewallets_giftcards`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:176
msgid ":doc:`../products_prices/loyalty_discount`"
msgstr ":doc:`../products_prices/loyalty_discount`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:177
msgid ":doc:`../products_prices/prices/pricing`"
